<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">– Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evangeli thza Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Evangeli thza</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="rem">Ecidimukithsa yo Evangeli thza Luka</para>
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka oyu wa endangire na kanganda Paulu yo wa ñorire ethzi vuka, karo yo wa ñorire no vuka thzEtenda yo Tunganda twa Yesu. Shime a ñorerire munu o mukuru mu thsivaka o dithzina dyo Teofile. Ngwa oyu munu shime ekarire muendithsi o Muroma. Teofile wa yuvire imweya yo Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Yesu Krisitu. Luka shime a fotire ku mu dimukithsa shemwa ci eyi a yuvire keyi ya Yesu po yashemwa. Luka ngou a i mu ñorerire ko kuyara, ku tatekera yo kwerekiwa kwa Yesu, omu a yoyerire, erongithsa yenthzi, edi a fire nedi a pindukire kwafu ko ku i randererithsa edi yekarire.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka wa tanarithsire ku amba ci Yesu po Fumu karo yodiyo Muyoyithsi wanu wahe. Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Yesu po waa keya kwanu wahe mu kaye. Pakuninga ci Luka po kadi nedi Mujuda karo noyu a ñorerire kadi nedi Mujuda, ongi wethsemwa no thsithzo thso Thsijuda wa i tongononangire.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 1.1-80 Kangeru kaa tongora yo kwerekiwa kwa Johani mukwakukorovethza no kwerekiwa kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 2.1-52 Kwerekiwa kwa Yesu no wanuke wenthzi.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 3.1 - 4.13 Kuroithsa dikuñwa.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 3.1-22 Johani aa korovethza anu no ku korovethza Yesu.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 3.23-37 Mundandwe o mukuta wa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 4.1-13 Satana edi a tumaurire Yesu mu dikunguthsitu.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 4.14 - 9.50 Yesu aa tongora Muthzimbu Ouwa no ku kwama ekomokithsa mu Galilea.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 9.51 - 19.28 Yesu aa rongithsa no ku kwama ekomokithsa o ku thza ku Yerusalema ku tunda ku Galilea.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 19.29 - 23.56 Eyi ya tendaharire mu Yerusalema yo ku thzekithsiwa kwa Yesu no ku mwamba pa mbinda.</para>
  <para style="rem">Luka 24.1-53 Yesu aa pinduka kwafu no ku thzina mu wiru.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Luka aa tongora eyi a ñorerire Evangeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ku koe shokuru Teofile, anu owangi na ereka ku ñora enu eyi na i tende ku citombora muno mu mwetu ko ku i randererithsa, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />eci dyodi a i tu rundurwerire mambangi awa a i cimonenine ku tunda ku matatekero, awo akwakuhonga diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Shokuru Teofile, pakuninga ci name na ni i fotithsithsa yoihe eyo ku tunda ku matatekero, na ni mono ci ku di nawa ku i ku ñorera yoihe ko kuciranderera. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Naa kwama kengeyo ci o dimuke shemwa ko kuyara yoihe eyi no rongithsiwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kangeru kaa tongora yo kwerekiwa kwa Johani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Kethsiya thsikati Heroda o ku di fumu mu Judea, kwekarire mupurisita o dithzina dyo Zakariya, o mu shayo thzo thsipurisita thsa Abiya. Munuwenthzi po nedi Elizaveta, o mu shayo thza mupurisita Aroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Momu widi wo ekarire owawawa pa meho a Nyambi, a hengekire mirao neraerera ya Fumu Nyambi yoihe ko kupira thso ku wa shomorora. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Unone ka wanine ana, pakuninga ci Elizaveta shime ekarire mvumi, karo momu widi wo a kuruparire nene.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Diyuwa dimweya Zakariya shime a kwamine ekwama yopurisita pa meho a Nyambi, shayo thzenthzi ou thzekarire pekwama. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" /><figure style="fig" alt="Zachariah at the altar 9" file="lb00263b.tif" size="col" loc="Luke 1:8-17" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="1.8-17">Zakariya ku katara</figure>Kokuthza ko thsithsemwa thso thsipurisita, wa hanguriwire ko ñera kwingena mu Tembere thza Fumu ku ka tumekera insense. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Thsikati thso ku tumekera insense ou thsa kumine, mbunga thzothzihe thzekarire pora o ku thzi rombera.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kangeru ka Fumu ka hokokire ku kwenthzi, ka nemanine ku rudyo ro katara, apa a tumekerire insense. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya ou a ka monine, wa cishutukire no ku yapa. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Unone kangeru ka mu amberire ci: “Wa yapa, Zakariya! Nyambi o na yuvu thsirombero thsoe. Munu woe Elizaveta kenge a ku kwerekera mwana o mukwerumeana, wangu wa ku mu te dithzina dyo Johani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Kenge wa kwikara no thsinyanyu thsothsikuru nene, anu owangi kenge a ku nyanyukera kwerekiwa kwenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Inene kenge a kwikara o mukuru pa meho a Fumu, mbera ka a nu waine nji warwa ungana, kenge a ku yarithsiwa Mupepo Oukenu mane o ku shime no kwerekiwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Kenge a ku tangerera Maisiraele owangi ku wa huthsera kwa Fumu Nyambi wo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Kenge a ku thza ku rupara rwa Fumu ko mupepo nokoro eci Eliya mukwakukethza, ku thsiurwera micima thzashemi kwano. Kenge a ku huthsera akwamukanayuva kunyanyami wawawa, no ku roithsa anu awa a na ciroithsera Fumu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya wepurire kangeru ci: “Ngepi nga ni dimuka ci eyo po ya shemwa? Inene ame na munuwange po tu na kurupara.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Kangeru ka tawire ci: “Ame po yame no Gaburiele, oyu nemananga pa rupara rwa Nyambi ku mu kwamena, yo na ni tumu ku na ku tongwera ou muthzimbu ouwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Uno honi mbeci po ko tawire aa maywi o shemwa aa ni na ku ambera, kenge o wikara shiamba, ko wa ku twethsa ku amba shime mwanoe ou a ku shamurukiwa. Inene maywi ange kenge a ku tenda ku citombora mu thsikati ethsi thsi na roera.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mbunga ethzi thza tatererire Zakariya thza komokire inene wa ka thzihamine omo mu Tembere. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ou a punine ka a twethsire ku ambano, awopo a nangura ci na ka mona thsimona muya mu Tembere. Wa ambireno ko moko, karo wekarire kengeyo kadi wa ku twethsa ku amba.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Zakariya mayuwa enthzi ekwama yo mu Tembere ou a pwire, wa hukire ku diumbo dyenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mu mayuwa oapu Elizaveta munuwenthzi wa thzire poremu, wa cihorekire maonda o mutanu kadi wa ku punena pora. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Wa ambire ci: “Fumu na ni kwamena eyi, ku ni monithsa thsihemo no ku ni tundithsa mu honyi kwanu, thzo kukana ku wana mwana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kangeru kaa tongora yo kwerekiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elizaveta ou a mu pitire maonda o mutanu na thzofoci, Nyambi wa tumine kangeru Gaburiele mu diumbo dyo mu Galilea edi di nethsiwa Nazareta, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwa diungu oyu a ungekerire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Josefa, o mu mukuta wa Fumu Davida. Dithzina dyoyo diungu po Madiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Kangeru ka keyire ku kwenthzi no ku amba ci: “Shangwe owe o na herepiwa! Fumu noe a di.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Madiya ya mu tanganithsire eyi ka ambire kangeru no ku cikupaura ci kwa ngepi oku kuvumenena ko kenge. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Unone kangeru ka mu amberire ci: “Wa yapa Madiya, inene o na tambura thsihemo kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kenge wa ku thza poremu no kwereka mwana o mukwerumeana, wa ku mu te dithzina dyo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Kenge a kwikara o mukuru, karo kenge a kwithsiwa Mwana Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene. Fumu Nyambi kenge a ku mu pa ofumu o kuninga eci wa mukwathsañuru wenthzi Davida. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kenge mba a tumina mukuta wa Jakovo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isiraele.</char></note> myaka thzothzihe, karo kutumina kwenthzi kenge mba kwikara ko diyere.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Madiya wepurire kangeru ci: “Eyo ne ngepi ya ku dikara? Ame po no diungu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Kangeru ka tawire ci: “Mupepo Oukenu kenge wa ku shurumukera pa poe, okoro wa Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene, kenge wa ku ku thsika. Mweyo, oyu mwanuke o mukenu oyu wa kwerekiwa kenge a kwithsiwa Mwana Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />O anekere mwapoe Elizaveta oyu a na ninganga ci mvumi. Pano tu di poremu a di o mwana o mukwerumeana, thzino thzo ngonda thzo muthsitanu na thzofoci, shaanga ci na kurupara kengeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Inene kwa Nyambi po kwithsa thso ku kanga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Madiya wa ambire ci: “Ame po no mupika Fumu, i tendahare ku kwange eci dyodi o na i amba.” Popo kangeru ka mu thsiire.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madiya aa hungerithsa Elizaveta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mwao mayuwa Madiya wa ciroithserire no ku yakama ku thza ku ditunga dyo mikinya mu diumbo dyo mu Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Wa kengenine mu nthzio thza Zakariya no ku vumenena Elizaveta. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizaveta ou a yuvire oku kuvumenena kwa Madiya, mwanenthzi mu dira dyenthzi wa reareire. Elizaveta wa yarire Mupepo Oukenu <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />no ku tumuka ku amba ci: “O mukwa thsiyauthzi owe mu kaci kambuyama wahe! Wa thsiyauthzi oyu mwana wa kwereka. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Yaa dikara ngepi eyi ci na a ni hungerithse mama wa Fumu wange. <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Popaya ni yuva o ku ni vumenena, no mwana oyu di mu dira dyange shime aa rearea mukaci ko thsinyanyu. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />O di no thsiyauthzi owe no tawa ci eyi a ambire Fumu kenge ya ku tendahara.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dimbo dya Madiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Madiya wa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mucima wange wa shangara Fumu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Mwoyo wange wa nyanyukera Nyambi Muyoyithsi wange.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Inene na a ni vuruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ame no mupikenthzi o kushi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ku tunda pano mikuta thzothzihe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">kenge mba thzi nithsa ci no mukwa thsiyauthzi.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Pa ku ni kwamena enu yoshokuru aye Shokoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">dithzina dyenthzi dikenu.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Aa monithsa ñeke thzenthzi kwanu awa a na mu yapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">mu mikuta thzothzihe.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Na a kwama enu yoikuru kokoro wenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">na a shandura akwamununa mwianekera yo micima thzo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Na a turura mafumu o shokoro pa mangunja o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">no ku tungithsa apika.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Akwa kufa nthzara na a wekutithsa keyi yoiwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">Unone afumanyi naa wa huthsa mokomoko.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Naa kwathsa mupikenthzi Isiraele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">pa ku vuruka ku mu yuvera ñeke,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />eci dyodi a kumbwethzire akwathsañuruetu kwa Aburahama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">noku kwa mwanahoka wenthzi diyere.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Madiya wekarire maonda o ku fota ku kwana ahatu na Elizaveta mbeci a huke ku diumbo dyenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwerekiwa kwa Johani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Thsikati thsa Elizaveta thso ku shamuruka ou thsa kumine, wa shamurukire mwanenthzi o mukwerumeana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Andambo napenthzi ou a yuvire edi a mu fererire ñeke Fumu, wahe a keyire ku na mu shambirerithsako.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ou a kwanithsire mayuwa mutanu na ahatu anu wahe a keyire ku thsidika thsa mwanenthzi thso mukanda. A fotire ku mu ta dithzina dyo Zakariya dya tata wenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Unone Elizaveta wa ambire ci: “Dyombo, kadi kengeyo! Dithzina dyenthzi po Johani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Anu wahe a ambire ci: “Kwithsa munu o dyo dithzina mu mukuta wenu ouhe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />A ambire na tata wa kambu ko moko ku mwipura ci dithzina mwine a fotire ku ta mwanenthzi? <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Wa rombire po ku ñora, wa ñorirepo ci: “Dithzina dyenthzi po Johani.” Wahe a komokire. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Popo wa twethsire ku amba no ku tateka ku shangara Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Awa cihatireno wahe a tutukwire. Eyo enu ya yukire nene mu maumbo oahe o mu mikinya thza Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Wahe awa i yuvire eyi a i cikupaurire mu micima thzo no ku cipura ci: “Oyu mwanuke ne ngepi mba ekara?” Inene okoro wa Fumu nenthzi u di.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakariya aa shangara Fumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariya tata wa mwanuke wa yarire Mupepo Oukenu no kukethza ci:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Ku shangariwe Fumu Nyambi wa Isiraele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">inene o na keya ku na patura anuenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Na a tu pa Muyoyithsi shokoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">o mu mukuta wa Davida mupikenthzi,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />eci dyodi a i ambire ko tunwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">twakwakukethzenthzi owakenu o kukare.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Wa tu kumbwethzire ku tu amwena kwakwethzimbo yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">no ku tu amwena mu moko owa a na tu thzimbi wahe.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ko ku fera ñeke akwathsañuruetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">no ku vuruka thsiyuvano thsenthzi thsothsikenu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Wa cethzerire kwa tata wetu Aburahama,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ku tu amwena mu moko akwethzimbo yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">ci tu twethse ku mu kwamena ko kupira wowa,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />ci twikare mukenu nowawa pa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">meho enthzi mayuwa oahe o myoyo thzetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Owe o mwanange kenge a ku kuta ci Mukwakukethza woyu o Kuthzinama Nene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Kenge wa ku citangethza ku rupara ku roithsera Fumu dikuñwa dyenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />No ku na pa anuenthzi odimukero o kuyoyithsiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ko ku wa tetera evi yo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Inene Nyambi wetu po wa ku yara thsidirañeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">kenge a ku tu retera mwethzi o ku tunda ku wiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">o ku cipitura eci diyuwa edi di va.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Ku na munekera awa di mu mirema no mu muthzimbimbi o kufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ku tangerera edyato yetu mu dikuñwa dyo thsiyaro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Oyo mwana wa kurire no ku tanara mu mupepo. Wekarire mu dikunguthsitu shime ku kuma mu diyuwa edi a hokokire kwanu mu Isiraele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kwerekiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mwao mayuwa kwa tundire thsiraerera kwa Sesare Agusitu ci ku tariwe anu wahe awa a di mu matunga aa a na endithsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Oku kutara ko kutanga, kwa tendaharire Kwirino o ku di muendithsi wa Siria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Anu wahe a ka ciñorithsire munu no munu, ku diumbo dyo mukuta wa tata wenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Mweyo, Josefa naye wa tundire ku Galilea mu diumbo edi di nethsiwa Nazareta, ku thza ku Judea mu diumbo dya Davida edi di nethsiwa Betelehema, inene naye wa mu mukuta no dihumo dya Davida. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Wa ka ciñorithsire na Madiya oyu a ungekerire. Madiya wekarire poremu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />O kwa di mu Betelehema thsikati thsenthzi thso ku shamuruka thsa kumine. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Wa shamurukire mwedi wenthzi o mukwerumeana. Wa mu vungerire peto yombu no ku mu rangeka mu thsikungu, mukaci ko kuninga ci ka wanine maturero mu nthzio thzenda.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tungeru nadithsani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Omo mu ndau kwekarire adithsani po pepi awa a hungererire mitanga thzo othsiku. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Kangeru ka Fumu ka hokokire kukwo, kutethzima kwa Fumu kwa wa pakire mu kaci. Adithsani a cishutukire no ku yapa nene. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kangeru ka wa amberire ci: “Mwa yapa! Inene naa mi retera Muthzimbu Ouwa, ou wa ku retera thsinyanyu thsothsikuru anu wahe. Naa amba ci <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />uno othsiku, mu diumbo dya Davida mu nerekiwera muyoyithsi, Krisitu Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Kenge mu ka mu dimuka ko thsimonithso ethsi, kenge mu ka wana kambu aka ka na vungeriwa mwito no ku rangekiwa mu thsikungu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ko wanguwangu mungi o dikanga dyo mu wiru dyo tungeru wa ciwanine no Kangeru ko kutanga. Twa shangarire Nyambi no ku amba ci:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Kutethzima kwikare kwa Nyambi mu diwiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">thsiyaro thsenthzi thsikare kwanu wahe mu kaye awa a na mu roerithsa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Tungeru ou twa wa thsiire ku huka ku wiru, adithsani a ningire ci: “Tu thzenu ku Betelehema tu ka mone eyi i na tendahara, eyi a na tu tongwera Fumu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Adithsani a yakamenine ku Betelehema. A ka wanine a Madiya na Josefa no kambu aka ka na rangekiwa mu thsikungu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ou a ka mu monine, a tongorire eyi ka wa tongwerire kangeru yoyu mwanuke. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Wahe awa i yuvire ya wa komokithsire eyi a ambire adithsani. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Madiya aye wa pakire yoihe eyi enu mu mucima no ku i cikupaura. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Adithsani a hukire ku mitanga thzo o kwa ka thza o remeka Nyambi no ku mu shangara keyi a yuvire no ku mona, inene enu yoihe ya tendaharire komu ka wa tongwerire kangeru.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tiwa dithzina no ku twariwa mu Tembere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ou a kwanine mayuwa o mutanu na ahatu, a mu twarire ku mukanda oku a ka tiwerire edi dithzina dyo Yesu, dithzina edi ka mu tire kangeru, mama wenthzi o ku shime ku thza poremu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Mayuwa o ku cikenithsa ou a pwire kokuthza komu u na ambera Murao wa Mushe, a Madiya na Josefa a twarire mwano ku Yerusalema ku ka mu yareka kwa Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Inene mu Murao wa Fumu kwaa ñoriwa ci: “Mwedi yomuhe o mukwerumeana kenge mba a torweriwa Fumu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Diya 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>.</char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Mweyo, awopo a reta muyambo komu u na ambera Murao wa Fumu, “makuci edi nji mayembeana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Mali 12.6-8</ref>.</char></note>”.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simioni aa shangara Fumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Mu Yerusalema mwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Simioni. Oyu mukwerume wekarire munu o muwawa pa meho a Nyambi, karo wa cipakire kwa Nyambi. Wa tatererire Muyoyithsi wa Isiraele, karo Mupepo Oukenu wekarire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mupepo Oukenu wa mu dimukithsire ci ka a ku fa shime o ku na mono Mesiya oyu a kumbwethzire Fumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Wa keyire mu Tembere ko ku mu tangerera Mupepo Oukenu, a Josefa na Madiya a retire mwano Yesu mu Tembere eci omu u na ambera Murao. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simioni wa mu shimbire no ku mu kwaterera mu nyara thzenthzi, ayepo shangara Nyambi ci:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Fumu, thsikumbwethzo thsoe thsi na tendahara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">o thsie mupikoe a cithzere mu thsiyaro.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Inene meho ange a na mono kuyoyithsa koe,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />oku no roithsa pa meho o mambunga oahe.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ou po mwethzi ou wa ku hokora Nyambi kwAnukenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">karo waa pa kutethzima ku mbunga thzoe thza Isiraele.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tata wenthzi na mama wenthzi a komokire nene mwiambaura ya Simioni yoyu mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ngou Simioni a wa fiyawerire, wa amberire Madiya mama wa Yesu ci: “O mone, Nyambi na a hangura oyu mwanuke ci a retere Maisiraele owangi kunongithsiwa no kuyoyithsiwa, ethsi po thsimonithso thsa Nyambi ethsi mba hamura. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Mweyo, eanekera yo micima thzothzingi kenge mba i hokoriwa. Owe o mbuyama, mathsiwa oakuru kenge a ku ku kiña ku mucima eci mwere.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukwakukethza o mbuyama o dithzina dyo Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kwekarire mukwakukethza o mbuyama o dithzina dyo Ana, mwana Fanuelu, o ku mukuta wa Asere. Wa kuruparire nene. Ku tunda apa a yekiwerire wa yoyire pohuma myaka mutanu na thzidi na munu wenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ku tunda apo, wekarire difakathzi katere ku kwanithsa myaka 84. Ka a tundangire mu Tembere, wa kwamenine Nyambi othsiku no mutenya o ku rombera no ku cikanganga no nthzara. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Wa keyire mwethso thsikati, wa kandererire kwa Nyambi no ku ambaura yoya mwana kwanu wahe awa tatererire ci Nyambi a pature Yerusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ashemi a Yesu ou a manine enu yoihe kokuthza ko Murao wa Fumu, a hukire ku Galilea ku diumbo dyo dya Nazareta. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mweyo, mwana wa kurire no ku koropa, wa yarire onyanyami, karo thsihemo thsa Nyambi thsekarire pa penthzi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu o ku di no myaka thzo dikumi na thzidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Mwaka no mwaka ashemi a Yesu a thzangire ku Yerusalema ku thsidika thso Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu o ku di no myaka dikumi na thzidi, a thzire ku thsidika eci omu na kwamenanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Thsidika ou thsa pwire, a hukire ku diumbo dyo dya Nazareta, aye mwano Yesu wa thsiarire mu Yerusalema ashemienthzi ko kukana ku dimuka. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Awo shime a anekerire ci aa enda namweya. A thzire kengeyo diyuwa mutumbi shime runguro mbeci a ka mu tonde, no ku tateka ku mu fota mu kaci kapo naenthzo.<verse eid="LUK 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Unone ka mu wanine, ngou a hukire ku Yerusalema o kwa ka thza o mu fota. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu a ka mu wanine mu Tembere, o ku nekara mu kaci karongithsi o majuda o ku teerera kukwo no ku wepaura mangudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Awa a mu yuvire wahe a komokire mathsaano enthzi nedi a wa tawangire mangudi.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ashemienthzi a ka komokire ou a mu monine, mama wenthzi ayepo ninga ci: “Mwanange, ine o na i tu tendera kenge? O na mono tata woe name tu na shupeka nene ku ku fota.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Wa wa tawire ci: “Ine eyi mu na ni fotera? Ka mu dimukire ci naa roera kwikara mu nthzio thza tata nji?”. <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Unone awo ka yuvithsithsire eyi a wa amberire.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu wa hukireno ku Nazareta, wa cihuthsire kushi thzo, mama wenthzi aye wa i pakire yoihe eyo enu mu mucima wenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu wa kurire munyanyami nerama, karo wa roerithsire Nyambi nanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa ya Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu mwaka o dikumi na mutanu o kutumina kwa Tibere Sesare, Ponso Pilatu o ku di Muendithsi mu Judea, Heroda o ku di fumu mu Galilea, minenthzi Filipu o ku di fumu mu Iturea no mu Tirakonita, Lisiniasi aye o ku di fumu omu Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />a Anasi na Kayafa awo o kwa di Mapurisita o shokuru, diywi dya Nyambi dya keyire kwa Johani mwana Zakariya o ku di mu dikunguthsitu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Wa thzire mu mandau oahe aa ekarire po pepi no Rware rwa Jorodani. Johani wa thzire o honga ci: “Mu cere evi yenu no ku korovethziwa, ci evi i teteriwe.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Eyo ya citomborire neyi a ñorire mukwakukethza Isaya mu vuka thzenthzi ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Diywi dyoyu kuerera mu dikunguthsitu dya amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mu roithse mukwakwa wa Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">mu orore makuñwa enthzi!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Mo kunoha mu huthseremo muve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mu kuyurure mikinyaana no mikinya thzoshokuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Yo ku peta mu i orore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mu hutere macuvunguru aa a di mu makuñwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Anu wahe kenge a ku mona kuyoyithsa kwa Nyambi.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40.3-5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Ngou a amberire mbunga ethzi thza keyire ku na korovethziwa ci: “Amwe mwana mayoka! Edye naa mi nomenithsa ku cira kuanthzi wa Nyambi ou u keya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mweyo, mu kwame ekwama eyi i na monithsa kucera evi yenu. Mwa tateka ku amba mu micima thzenu ci: ‘Tu di no tata wetu Aburahama.’ Inene naa mi tongwera ci Nyambi aa twethsa ku kwamena Aburahama ana poa mawe aa! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Kamo ka na pakiwa kare pa mithzithzi thzetondo. Thsitondo no thsitondo thso kukana kwima ima yoiwa thsa ku henduriwe no ku kuheriwa mu mudiro.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Mbunga thza mwipurire ci: “Ine eyi tu na roera ku tenda?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Aye wa wa tawire ci: “Oyu di nekoveyo idi a peko thsimweya oyu na piri: Oyu di nedya, a tende naye kengeyo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Aterithsi nawo a keyire ku na wa korovethza. Epurire Johani ci: “Murongithsi, ine eyi tu na roera ku tenda?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Wa tawire ci: “Mwa terithsa munu ku piterera omu ku na roera.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Mashwarare nawo a mwipurire ci: “Atwe ne, ine tu na roera ku tenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Wa wa amberire ci: “Mwa shimba thso munu kokoro nji ku mu thsinenekethza eyi a na kana ku kwama: Mu rakwe madi aa mu hora.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Mbunga ethzi thza tatererire Mesiya ko ku kurupera nene, thzothzihe thza cipaurire mu micima thzo ya Johani ci ngwa yodiyo Mesiya. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Johani wa wa tawire wahe ci: “Ame naa mi korovethza ko meyu, uno honi o mukoro kupita ame aa keya, ka ni roerire shaanga ku putura tuangithso to mashangu enthzi. Kenge a ku na mi korovethza ko Mupepo Oukenu no mudiro. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka ni roerire kwikara mupikenthzi.</char></note> Kenge a ku na mi korovethza ko Mupepo Oukenu no mudiro. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Thsihere thsenthzi mu moko enthzi thsi di ku yererekethza vuroto. Kenge a ku kundura oheke pa thsihoto no ku u paka mu thsishepa thsenthzi, uno honi muyungu ao kenge a ku u tumeka ko mudiro u shithzimana.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Keyo neyi imweya ethsiurura yoingi, Johani wa hongire anu Muthzimbu Ouwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Unone honi wa shomororire Fumu Heroda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heroda Antipasi Fumu o mu Galilea.</char></note> pa ku yeka Herodiasi, munu wa minenthzi, neyi imweya yoimango eyi a tendire. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Omango oshokuru o ku piterera ou a kwamine Heroda po o ku paka Johani mu kamenga.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa korovethziwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Anu wahe ou a korovethziwire, Yesu naye wa korovethziwire. O ku rombera diwiru dya yanthzurukire. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Mupepo Oukenu wa shurumukerire pa penthzi ko thsikupuro thso dikuci. Kwa yuvaharire diywi ku wiru ci: “O Mwanange oyu na shima no ku ni roerithsa nene.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dihumo dya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu wekarire no myaka thzo makumi ahatu, ou a tatekire ku rongithsa, anu wahe shime a anekerire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yesu po mwana Josefa, Josefa mwana Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli mwana Matati, Matati mwana Livi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Livi mwana Meleki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Meleki mwana Janai, Janai mwana Josefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Josefa mwana Matatia,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Matatia mwana Amosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amosi mwana Nahumi, Nahumi mwana Esili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esili mwana Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai mwana Maate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Maate mwana Matatia, Matatia mwana Semeini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeini mwana Joseke, Joseke mwana Joda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Joda mwana Joanani, Joanani mwana Resa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa mwana Zerubabele, Zerubabele mwana Salatiele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">Salatiele mwana Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri mwana Meleki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Meleki mwana Adi, Adi mwana Kosama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosama mwana Elimadama, Elimadama mwana Eri,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri mwana Joshua, Joshua mwana Eliazare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliazare mwana Jorimi, Jorimi mwana Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matati mwana Livi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Livi mwana Simioni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simioni mwana Juda, Juda mwana Josefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">Josefa mwana Jonami, Jonami mwana Eliakimi,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakimi mwana Meleya, Meleya mwana Mena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mena mwana Matata, Matata mwana Natani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">Natani mwana Davida, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Davida mwana Jese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Jese mwana Obedi, Obedi mwana Boazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boazi mwana Salimoni, Salimoni mwana Nashoni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni mwana Aminadabi, Aminadabi mwana Adamina, Adamina mwana Arini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Arini mwana Hesiromi, Hesiromi mwana Paresi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">Paresi mwana Juda, Juda mwana Jakovo,<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Jakovo mwana Isaka, Isaka mwana Aburahama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">Aburahama mwana Tera, Tera mwana Nakori,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nakori mwana Serugi, Serugi mwana Reu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reu mwana Pelegi, Pelegi mwana Ebere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebere mwana Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala mwana Kainani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kainani mwana Arifakasadi, Arifakasadi mwana Sema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">Sema mwana Nuwe, Nuwe mwana Lameki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki mwana Metusela, Metusela mwana Enoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enoke mwana Jaredi, Jaredi mwana Mahalalele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalalele mwana Kainani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainani mwana Enoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enoshi mwana Seta, Seta mwana Adama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adama mwana Nyambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Satana aa tumaura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu wa hukire ku tunda ku Jorodani o ku na yara Mupepo Oukenu. Mupepo Oukenu wa mu twarire mu dikunguthsitu, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />oku a ka mu tumawerire shamaonga mu mayuwa o makumi ane. Ka a dire mwao mayuwa, ku hura wa fire nthzara.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shamaonga wa mu amberire ci: “Ngeci yowe o Mwana Nyambi, o tumine edi diwe di piruke dikende.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa ci: Munu tumba a yoyo ko dikende pohuma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Mura 8.3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Shamaonga wa mu thzinithsire pa mukinya no ku mu monithsa kamanana ofumu ouhe o kaye. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Shamaonga wa mu amberire ci: “Kenge ni ku pa ouhe ou okoro no kutethzima kwao, inene na i piwa ku kwange, karo naa twethsa ku i pa yomuhe oyu ni na foto. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Mweyo, ngeci o ni rombere, kenge ni i ku pa yoyihe.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa ci: O tongamene Fumu Nyambi woe, karo o kwamene aye pohuma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Mura 6.13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Satana wa mu twarire ku Yerusalema no ku ka mu thzinithsa pa mutuya o Tembere. Wa mu amberire ci: “Ngeci yowe o Mwana Nyambi, o reere pashi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Inene ku na ñoriwa ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">“Kenge a ku tumina tungeru twenthzi ku na ku nyunga,<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />na tu kwakwere ko moko ato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">ci katere thsi kuruke thsidyato thsoe ku diwe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Mem 91.11-12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ku na ambiwa ci: ‘Katere o ereke Fumu Nyambi woe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mura 6.16.</char></note>.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Shamaonga ou a manine ku tumaura Yesu, wa mu yembukire shime apa a wanenine thsikati karo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tateka ekwama yenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu wa hukire ku Galilea o ku na yara okoro o Mupepo Oukenu. Muthzimbu keyi yenthzi wa thzire kokuhe muya mu ditunga. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Wa rongithsire mu masinagoge o, anu wahe a mu shangarire.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kaniwa mu Nazareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu wa thzire ku Nazareta ku diumbo dyenthzi oku a kurerire. Eci edi naa kwamanga, wengenine mu sinagoge dyo Savata. Wemanine ku tara diywi, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />a mu pire vuka thza Mukwakukethza Isaya. Wa thsikurire vuka no ku wana apa ku na ñoriwa ci:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Mupepo wa Fumu pa pange u di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">inene naa ni wethse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ku na honga ahepwe Muthzimbu Ouwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Aa ni tuma ku na honga yo kupaturiwa kowa na kupariwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">no ku na monithsa tupuputwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ku na patura awa a nyandithsiwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:10-12">Mali 25.10-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> no ku na dimukithsa yo mwaka ou thsa ku monahara thsihemo thsa Fumu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa 61.1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Wa thsikire vuka no ku thzi pa mukwakunyunga sinagoge no kwikara pashi. Anu wahe awa ekarire omo mu sinagoge a mu rupukerire. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Yesu wa tatekire ku wa rongithsa ci: “Rero edi Diñoro di na citombora neyi a ñorire mukwakukethza Isaya mwahe o ku mu ciyuvera.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Wahe a tatekire ku amba yoiwa keyi yenthzi, a komokire maywi o thsihemo aa a tundire mu kanwa kenthzi, awopo a amba ci: “Ene oyu ne kadi yodiyo mwana Josefa?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Aye wa wa amberire ci: “Ni na dimuka ci kenge mu ni tera mutangu o ku amba ci: ‘Mukwakupanga o ciporithse othsinda!’ Eyi na tu yuvu ci shime waa i kwama ku Kapenauma o i kwame no kuno ku diumbo dyoe.”<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Wa shumunine ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa Mukwakukethza o ku tamburiwa nawa mu ditunga dyenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Yoshemwa kwekarire mafakathzi oangi mu Isiraele mu thsikati thsa Eliya mvura ou a kanine ku roka mu myaka thzihatu no maonda mutanu na thzofoci, ou kwekarire ndombo thzothzikuru mu ditunga dyodihe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Unone Eliya ka a tumiwire shaanga kwa munu yofoci powo mafakathzi, unone wa tumiwire ku difakathzi o ku Sarepita mu ditunga dya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Karo kwekarire akwengondwe owangi mu Isiraele<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Maf 5.1-14</ref>.</char></note> mu thsikati thsa mukwakukethza Elisha, unone kwithsa shaanga yofoci oyu wa porithsiwire, shime Naamani o ku Siria.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Anu wahe awa ekarire mu sinagoge a anthzipire nene ou a yuvire eyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />A katukire no ku mu tundithsa mu mbongi no ku mu twara peuru thzo mukinya apa thza umbiwerire mbongi ci a ka mu thsindekere pashi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Unone aye wa wa pitire mu kaciko no ku cithzera.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu o mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu wa urumukire ku thza ku Kapenauma, diumbo dyo mu Galilea. Wa rongithsire anu mu diyuwa dyo Savata. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />A komokire kerongithsa yenthzi, inene wa rongithsire kokoro.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Omo mu sinagoge kwekarire munu oyu wekarire no mupepo o muthzimu, mupepo oumango. Wa kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Waa fota thsine ku kwetu, Yesu wa Nazareta? Ene waa keyera ku na twipaa nji? Ni na ku dimuka yowe O Shokenu wa Nyambi!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu wa kutururire oo mupepo oumango ci: “O tutware! O tunde koyu munu!” Mupepo oumango wa mu huwerire pashi anu o kwa na tanekera, wa tundire ku kwenthzi ko kukana ku mu kurura.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Anu wahe a komokire, a ambire ci: “Edi diywi dyenthzi ne dya ngepi? Aa tumina mathzimu kofumu nokoro karo aa mu yuvera no ku tunda!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Muthzimbu keyi ya Yesu wa thzire mu ditunga dyodihe.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa ngumwenya Simoni nanu amweya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu wa tundire mu sinagoge no ku kengena mu nthzio thza Simoni. Wa ka wanine ngumwenya Simoni o ku kora nene dihokoma, a mu rombire ci a mu kwathse. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Wa thzire no ku kemana ku nyonga thzodidi apa a rarire no ku tumina dihokoma ci di tunde. Dihokoma dya mu pwire, popo wa katukire no ku tateka ku wa kwamena edya.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ou dya tokire diyuwa, anu wahe awa a korithsire apo mawethzi o mishovoshovo a wa retire ku kwenthzi, wa na wa porithsire ko ku kambeka moko peuru thzo munu no munu. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mathzimu a tundire kwanu owangi o ku a ka thza o kuerera ci: “Yowe O Mwana Nyambi!” Unone Yesu wa a kutururire, karo ka a a tawethzire ku amba, inene ao po a dimukire ci yodiyo Mesiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa honga mu masinagoge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mar 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Popa dya vire diyuwa wa tundire mu diumbo no ku thza kokumengi. Anu owangi a tatekire ku mu fota. Ou a ka mu wanine, a erekire ku mwinda ci a thza kumweya. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Unone Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Naa roera ku thza ku ka honga Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi ku maumbo amweya, inene eyo yodiyo na ni tumiwera.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Mweyo, wa thzire o honga mu masinagoge oahe mu Judea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa erongwa yo kutanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Diyuwa dimweya, Yesu wemanine pa diya dyo Diviya dya Genesareta. Anu a cithsindakanenine ku kwenthzi ci na yuve diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Wa monine mato edi o ku a na thsekeriwa mu diya, unone eyambi yothsi ayo o ku i na tundumo, o ku i yoa matuwa ayo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Wa shamukerire mu wato umweya no ku romba thsinda thsa wato Simoni Peturu ci a u thsindekere pa meyu. Wa kekarire mu wato no ku tateka ku rongithsa mbunga.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ou a manine ku rongithsa, wa amberire Simoni ci: “O hunyune wato woe honi o thze po shothzungi mu ka kuhere matuwa enu mu koke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni wa tawire ci: “Ñathsire wange, tu na vendana othsiku ouhe, kwithsa ethsi tu na wana. Unone ko diywi dyoe kenge ni kuhera matuwa karo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />A thzire no ku ka tateka ku kuhera matuwa o. Ou a kokire, a waninepo ethsi thzothzingi kuninga ci shaanga matuwa o a tatekire ku yatuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />A rapethzire aenthzo awa ekarire mu wato umweya ku ninga ci na wa kwathse. Nawo a keyire, a yarithsire mato o momu widi wao, mane shime aa fota no ku rowera.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Peturu ou a monine kengeyo, wa keyire no ku na wera ku mauru a Yesu no ku amba ci: “Fumu, o tunde ku kwange, inene no munu o thsivi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Aye nowa ekarireno a komokire nene ongi wethzo ethsi a wanine. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />A Jakovo na Johani ana Zebedea aenthza Simoni nawo a komokire. Yesu wa amberire Simoni ci: “Wa yapa, ku tunda rero kenge o yambanga anu honi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ou a ka kumithsire mato pa dikambo, Simoni, Jakovo na Johani a thsiire enu yoihe no ku shupwera Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwengondwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu o ku di mu diumbo dimweya, kwa keyire mukwerume oyu wa korire nene engondwe. Ou a monine Yesu, wa na kupamine ku mauru enthzi no ku mu adikanena ci: “Fumu, nga o i shime kenge nga o ni porithsa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu wa ororire dyoko dyenthzi no ku mu kwata ci: “Ni na i shimi, o pore.” Ko wanguwangu engondwe ya pwire. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Wa mu amberire ci: “Katere i tongwere munu eyi. O thze kwa mupurisita a ka ku mone. O ka punithse thsikunda thso kukenithsiwa koe, eci edi a i raire Mushe ci ikare ombangi kwanu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Muthzimbu keyi ya Yesu wa henyine nene, mane anu owangi a keyire ku kwenthzi ku na teerera diywi dya Nyambi no ku na porithsiwa kwikora yo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Unone rorungi Yesu wa thzangire kokumengi ku ka rombera.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa o kuara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu o ku rongithsa, Afarithsi narongithsi o murao ekarire po pepi nenthzi, awa a tundire mu maumbo oahe a Galilea na Judea no mu Yerusalema. Okoro wa Fumu o ku porithsa ekora wekarire kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kwa keyire akwerume awa a shimbire munu o kuara podidi. Shime fotire kwingena ci a mu tware kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Unone ko ku vura nene mbunga, a pirire ko ku pitera. A thzinine pa thsituwa thso nthzio omu ekarire Yesu no ku ka thsi tuyura. Ngou a shurumweninemo mwethzi nodidi wenthzi mukaci kanu pa rupara rwa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu ou a monine thsitawo thso wa amberire oyo mukwerume ci: “Shadi, evi yoe i na teteriwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Arongithsi o murao nAfarithsi a tatekire ku cipaura ci: “Edye oyu o ku yengwa kengeya? Edye o ku twethsa ku tetera evi ngeci kadi Nyambi yofoci?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu wa dimukire eanekera yo, ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mwaa cipaura ine mu micima thzenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Thso thsoto ne thsipi, no ku amba ci: evi yoe i na teteriwa, nji ku amba ci, o katuke o ende? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Uno honi naa fota ci mu dimuke ci Mwana Munu o di nokoro o ku tetera evi muno mu kaye.” Wa amberire oyo mukwerume o ku ara ci: “Naa ku ambera, o katuke, o shimbe odidi woe, o thze ku diumbo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Popo wemanine mu kaciko, no ku shimba odidi apa a mu rangekire, ayepo thza ku diumbo o ku ka thza o shangara Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />A komokire wahe no ku shangara Nyambi. A yapire nene no ku amba ci: “Rero tu na mono enu yo ku komokithsa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa Livi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Munyima thzeyo, Yesu wa tundire mu mbongi, wa monine muterithsi o dithzina dyo Livi, o ku nekara mu ofithsi thzenthzi. Wa mu amberire ci: “O ni shupwere, o wikare thsirongwa thsange.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Wa katukire, wa thsiire enu yoihe no ku mu shupwera.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Munyima, Livi wa ka tenderire Yesu dishambirera dyodikuru ku nthzio thzenthzi. Wa raire aterithsi owangi nene nanu amweya awa a ka direno. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Afarithsi narongithsi o murao ou a i monine a shonaurire no kwipura erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ine eyi mu dyera no ku nwa naterithsi nanu wevi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Anu o kukana ku kora tumba foto mukwakupanga, shime awa a na koro wodiyo o ku fota mukwakupanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ka na ni keyera anu owawawa, unone naa keyera ku nethsa anu wevi, awa a na roera ku cera.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi keyi yo ku cikanganga no nthzara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Anu amweya a amberire Yesu ci: “Erongwa ya Johani yaa cikanganga no nthzara rorungi no ku rombera, nerongwa yAfarithsi nayo yaa tendanga kengeyo, uno honi eyi erongwa yoe ayo po yaa dya no ku nwa ne ine?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ene ambusha mukwakuyeka ne aa cikanganga no nthzara mu thsidika o kwa di na mukwakuyeka nji? Dyombo! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Unone honi thsikati kenge thsa ku keya ou a ku tundithsiwa mukwakuyeka mu kaciko, apo honi kenge a ku cikanga no nthzara.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Karo wa wa terire kathsimo ci: “Kwithsa munu o ku yatura thsikoveyo thsenthzi thsothsipe ci a shimbepo thsikamba a pake pa thsikoveyo thsenthzi thsothsikurukuru. Kamona ayepo tenda kengeyo a epithsa thsikoveyo thsothsipe, nathso thsikamba ka thsa ku roera pa thsikoveyo thsothsikurukuru. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Karo kwithsa munu o ku rongera waine omupe mu tuhupa totukurukuru. Ngeci ayepo tenda kengeyo, waine omupe kenge a yatura tuhupa karo waine kenge a mwaara, no tuhupa kenge twipa. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Waine omupe aa roera ku rongeriwa mu tuhupa totupe. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kwithsa munu o ku fota ku nwa waine omupe, o ku na nu o kare. Kenge a ninga ci: ‘O kare yo muwa nene.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu po Fumu o diyuwa dyo Savata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Diyuwa dimweya dyo Savata, Yesu wa pitire mu kaci ko makanda o mahangu. Erongwa yenthzi ya corire mashakara o mahangu omo mu makanda a pitire no ku a fenya mu moko o no ku dya oheke. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Afarithsi amweya epurire ci: “Ine eyi mu tendera eyi i na kana ku tawethziwa mu diyuwa dyo Savata?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ene ka mwa tara eyi a tendire Davida nanuenthzi ou a fire nthzara? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Wengenine mu nthzio thza Nyambi no ku shimba makende a a tupwerire Nyambi. Wa dire eyi i na tawethziwa pohuma ku diwa ku mapurisita. Wa pireko makende amweya anuenthzi.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Mwana Munu po yodiyo Fumu o dyo diyuwa dyo Savata.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu o ku kukutera dyoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Diyuwa dimweya dyo Savata karo, Yesu wengenine mu sinagoge no ku tateka ku rongithsa. Omo mu sinagoge kwekarire mukwerume o ku kukutera dyoko dyo rudyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Arongithsi o murao nAfarithsi ondamenine ci a mone Yesu o ku porithsa munu mu diyuwa dyo Savata, ci ou a i mu monena o ku i tenda a mu cape yoingi.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Unone Yesu wa dimukire eanekera yo, ayepo ambera mukwa ku kukutera dyoko ci: “O wiye kuno no wimane pa rupara rwanu.” Ayepo katuka no ku kemanapo.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu ayepo amba kukwo ci: “Naa mipura, ene murao ne waa tawethza ku tenda yoiwa nji, inji yoimango mu diyuwa dyo Savata? Ku yoyithsa mwoyo nji, inji ku wipithsa?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Wa endithsire meho enthzi no ku kenga anu wahe mbeci a ambere mukwa ku kukutera dyoko ci: “O orore dyoko dyoe.” Wa tendire kengeyo, dyoko dyenthzi adyopo di hukera nawa. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Mweyo, Afarithsi narongithsi o murao a anthzipire nene no ku tateka ku ciyongora edi nga twethsa ku tenda Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hangura tunganda to dikumi na twidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mwao mayuwa Yesu wa thzire pa mukinya ku ka rombera. Wa ka kuñwerire othsiku ouhe o ku rombera kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />A na ci mathsiku, wethserire erongwa yenthzi yoihe ku kwenthzi no ku hangura o dikumi naidi, awa a tire ci tunganda. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Aa po odiyo mathzina o: Simoni oyu a tire ci Peturu na minenthzi Andereasi, Jakovo na Johani, Filipu na Batolomeu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateu na Tomasi, Jakovo mwana Alufea na Simoni oyu nethsiwa ci Zeloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Judasi mwana Jakovo na Judasi Isikariota oyu wa mu kwatithsire.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbunga thzaa shupwera Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ou a urumukireno ku tunda pa mukinya, a nemanine pa kandaana apa yekarire erongwa yenthzi yoingi no mbunga thzothzikuru ethzi thza tundire mu Judea yomuhe no mu Yerusalema no ku kakuro ko diwate ku Tire na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Shime a keyire ku na teerera no ku na porithsiwa kwikora yo, karo akwamathzimu a porithsiwire. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Munu no munu wa erekire ku mu kwata, inene aye wekarire nokoro oku porithsa munu yomuhe.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiyauthzi nothsimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu wa kamburire meho no ku kenga erongwa yenthzi, ayepo amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Akwa thsiyauthzi ahepwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">inene Kutumina kwa Nyambi po kwenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mwakwa thsiyauthzi amwe mu fa nthzara thsino thsikati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">inene kenge mwa kwikuta!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mu di no thsiyauthzi amwe mu dira thsino thsikati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">inene kenge mwa ku hekaheka!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Mwakwa thsiyauthzi anu yoihe a mi thzimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ku mi kana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">ku mi tukathzana no ku amba ci mwanu owamango mukaci ka Mwana Munu!<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />“Ou ya ku tendahara eyo mwa ku nyanyuke no ku rearea ko thsinyanyu, inene muyambo wenu mu wiru ukuru ou mu na turekiwera. Inene nakwathsañuru wo dya tendire akwakukethza!<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Unone mwakwothsimo amwe mwa kwa ku fuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">inene na mu wana kare ohengawethzo wenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mwakwothsimo amwe mwikuta thsino thsikati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">inene kenge mwa kufa nthzara!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mwakwothsimo amwe mu hekaheka thsino thsikati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">inene kenge mwa ku dira makuano!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Othsimo po wenu amwe a shangara thsino thsikati, inene nakwathsañuru wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">dyo na shangaranga akwakukethza o mbango.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu shime akwethzimbo yenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Unone ame naa ambera amwe mu na ni teerera ci mu shime akwethzimbo yenu, mu tende nawa awa na mi thzimbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Mu fiyawere awa mi tuka, mu romberere awa mi nyandithsa. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ngeci munu aa ku fura ku ditama, o mu pe nedi dimweya kengeyo, o ku ku nyanga vaki woe, wa mu kanithsa ku shimberera no hembe kengeyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />O pe oyu na rombo yomuhe, karo ethsi o na nyangiwa wa fota ci thsi ku hukere. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Dyodi mu na foto anu amweya ku mi kwama, namwe mu wa kwame kengeyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Ngeci amwepo mu shima pohuma awa na mi shimi ne thsine mwa ku shangariwerapo? Inene nanu wevi aa shima awa a na wa shimi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Karo ngeci mwaa kwama nawa kowa a na mi kwamanga nawa, pene apa ku mi shangarera? Inene nanu wevi nawo aa kwamanga kengeyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Karo ngeci mwaa korotithsa pohuma awa mu na kurupera ci kenge a ku mi huthsera ne, thsine mwa ku shangariwerapo? Nanu wevi nawo a korotithsanga anu wevi ko ku kurupera ci kenge a ku wa huthsera.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />“Uno honi amwe mu shime akwethzimbo yenu, mu wa tende nawa, karo mu korotithse ko kukana ku kurupera ci a ku mi huthsere, muyambo wenu wangu wa kwikare oukuru, karo kenge mwa kwikara ana Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene. Inene aye po o di no thsihemo no ku kowa a na kana ku citarura keyi a na wa kwamena, mofoci kengeyo nanu owamango. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mwikare no ñeke eci edi a di no ñeke Tata wenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa ratura amweya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mwa ratura, namwe ka mwa ku raturiwa; mwa shomorora, namwe ka mwa ku shomororiwa; mu tetere, namwe kenge mwa ku teteriwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mu pe, namwe kenge mwa ku piwa. Mucekero ouwa, o ku thsinderiwa no ku nyungiwa shime ku yupathzoka kenge wa ku pakiwa mu thsimbata thsoe. Inene thsothsi thsianekethzithso mu cikwathsithsa thsothsa ku cikwathsithsiwa ku mi huthsera.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Karo wa wa terire mutangu ci: “Ene kengenga i tawa ci kapuputwa a tangerere muenthzenthzi kapuputwa nji? Ene nga ka ka wera wahe mu diteke? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Thsirongwa tumba a piti murongithsi wenthzi, unone o ku na pu ku rongithsiwa, aa twethsa ku cishoka na murongithsi wenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Ngepi edi nga o mona kahonyi aka ka di mu dithziho dya muenthzoe owe o ku di no thsithsini mu dithziho dyoe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Owe o mukwamahetaheta, ngepi edi nga o ambera muenthzoe ci: ‘O keye ni ku toore kahonyi aka ka di mu dithziho dyoe,’ owe o ku di no thsithsini mu dithziho dyoe? O tange tango ku tundithsa thsithsini ethsi thsi di mu dithziho dyoe, mbeci o mone nawa no ku tundithsa kahonyi aka ka di mu dithziho dya muenthzoe.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitondo no ima yathso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Kwithsa thsitondo thsothsiwa thso kwima ima yoimango, karo kwithsa thsitondo thsothsimango thso kwima ima yoiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Thsitondo no thsitondo thsa ku dimukera kweyi yemako, kwithsa o ku koyora ñuyu ku musheunga, karo kwithsa o ku koyora thsikocera thso veine ku mukona. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Kwa munu o muwa kwa ku tunda yoiwa eyi yekara mu thsinyungero thso mu mucima wenthzi ouwa. Kwa munu o mumango kwa ku tunda yoimango eyi yekara ku mucima wenthzi oumango. Inene mu kanwa ko munu mwa ku tunda eyi yekara ku mucima wenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akwakuumba aidi o nthzio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Mwaa nithsera ine ci: ‘Fumu, Fumu,’ oku mu kana ku tenda eyi ni mi ambera? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Kenge ni mi tongwera edi a cipitura munu o ku keya ku kwange no ku yuva maywi ange no ku i tenda. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Aa cipitura eci munu o ku umbera nthzio pa diwe, aa thsima ku thzungithsa no ku shisha mushisho. Meyu o ku pupa yoihe a keya, muronga waa cora ku tamba apo pa nthzio unone meyu kadi a ku twethsa ku thzi nyanganyithsa, inene na thzi umbiwa nawa. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Unone o ku yuva no kukana ku i tenda aa cipitura eci munu o ku umbera nthzio pa muve ko kupira ku shisha mushisho. Meyu o ku pupa yoihe a keya, aa na thzi thsindura. Kuthsinduka kwethzo nthzio, kenge kwa ku reta kwiperera kwathzo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitawo thsa mukuru o mashwarare o Maroma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyo yoyihe kwanu, wa thzire ku Kapenauma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Kethso thsikati, mupika muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma oyu a shimine nene wa korire nene o ku kokangera. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Oya muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ou a yuvire ya Yesu, wa tumine akuru o Majuda ku ka mu romba ci a keye na a mu porithsere mupikenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ou a ka kumine kwa Yesu, a ka mu adikanenine nene ku mu romba ci: “Oyu munu oyu aa roera ku kwathsiwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Inene aa shima nene ditunga dyetu, yodiyo wa tu umberire no sinagoge.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu wa thzireno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Ou a kumine po pepi, oya muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma wa tumine karo ambushenthzi kwa Yesu ci: “Wa ciayithsa Fumu, inene ka i roerire ci o keye mu nthzio thzange. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Mane ame naa cishimba ci ka ni roerire ku keya ku koe. Unone o ambe pohuma diywi no mupikange kenge a pora. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Inene name mushi thzokoro thzowa a na ni endithsa ni di, karo name ni di no mashwarare aa ni na endithsa. Ku ambera yumweya ci: ‘O thze,’ aa thza. Ku tumina yumweya ci: ‘O keye,’ aa keya. Karo ngeci naa ambera mupikange ci: ‘O kwame eyi,’ aa i kwama.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu ou a yuvire eyo wa komokire nene. Wa thsiurukerire kwanu awa a mu shupwerire no ku wa ambera ci: “Naa mi ambera ci ka na ni wana thsitawo thsothsikuru eci ethsi shaanga mu Isiraele.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Awa tumiwire a hukire ku nthzio thza mukuru o mashwarare, a ka wanine oya mupika wa korire o ku na poro ku porerera.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa pindura mwana difakathzi o mukwerumeana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Yesu wa thzire mu diumbo edi di nethsiwa Naine. Erongwa yenthzi nanu owangi a thzire nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ou a kokerire ku mengeneno o diumbo, wa hanganine anu awa a shimbire thsithzimbi o kwa thsi twara ku mararo ku ka thsi vumbeka. Oyu wa fire po nedi mwana yofoci pakamutwa o mukwerumeana kwa mama wenthzi o difakathzi. Mbunga thzothzikuru ku tunderera omo mu mbongi thzekarire nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Fumu ou a mu monine wa mu yuverire ñekeñeke. Wa mu amberire ci: “Wa dira!”<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Wa henyenine ku thsara no ku thsi kwata, awa a thsi shimbire emanine. Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mushumba, naa ku ambera ci o pinduke!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mufu wa pindukire no ku tateka ku amba. Yesu wa mu pire kwa mama wenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Anu wahe a yapire no ku shangara Nyambi ci: “Mukwakukethza shokuru mu kaci ketu a di,” “Nyambi na keya ku na kwathsa anuenthzi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Eyi a kwamine Yesu ya yukire nene mu ditunga dyodihe dya Judea no matunga aa a di po pepi na Judea.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Johani aa tuma erongwa yenthzi kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Erongwa ya Johani ya mu tongwerire ekwama yoihe ya Yesu aye o ku di mu kamenga. Mweyo, Johani wethsire idi ku kwayo, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />no ku i tuma kwa Fumu ku ka mwipura ci: “Ene yowe oyu tu taterera nji, nji tu taterereko wao?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ou ya ka kumine kwa Yesu, ya ka ambire ci: “Johani Mukwakukorovethza na tu tumu ku na kwipura ci: ‘Ene yowe oyu tu taterera nji, nji tu taterereko wao?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mwethso thsikati Yesu wa porithsire anu owangi awa ekarire nekora yo mishovoshovo, akwamathzimu, karo wa thsikurire meho o tupuputwa totungi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Mweyo, wa tawire erongwa ya Johani ci: “Mu huke kwa Johani mu ka mu tongwere eyi mu na mono no ku yuva. Tupuputwa twaa mona, ekunga yaa enda, akwengondwe aa pora, akwa kufa matwi aa yuva, afu aa pinduka no ku yoya, karo Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi waa hongiwa kwahepwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Wa thsiyauthzi munu o kukana ku huka munyima o ku na tawa ku kwange.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Erongwa ya Johani ou ya thzire, Yesu wa tatekire ku ambaura ku mbunga ya Johani ci, “Ou mwa thzire mu dikunguthsitu ne thsine mwa fotire ku ka mona? Dimbungu edi di pungithsiwa ku mupepo nji? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ngeci kadi kengeyo ne, edye oyu mwa fotire ku ka mona? Munu oyu na vata evata yoiwa nji? Dyombo! Awa a na vatanga evata yo kurerema po aa yoya nawa karo aekara mu marombe. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Unone edye oyu mwa thzererire ku ka mona? Mukwakukethza nji? Ii, naa mi tongwera ci Johani po mukuru kupita mukwakukethza. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Johani yodiyo oyu i na ñoriwa yenthzi mu Mañoro ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“ ‘Kenge na ku tuma kanganda kange ku rupara rwoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">ku ka ku roithsera dikuñwa dyoe.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />“Naa mi tongwera ci kwithsa munu oyu erekire mbuyama o mukuru kupita Johani. Unone o muonye mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi po mukuru kwa Johani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Anu wahe ou a yuvire eyi, mofoci kengeyo naterithsi, a tawire ci makuñwa a Nyambi po a ku oroka, inene shime korovethziwire ko korovethzo thza Johani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Unone Afarithsi nakwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda a kanine eanekera ya Nyambi pa ku kana ku wa korovethza Johani.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Wa ambire karo ci: “No thsine nga ni wa piturithsa anu o rerodino? Aa pitura thsine? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Aa cipitura eci anuke awa a di pa mbanthza o kwethsa aenthzo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">“ ‘Tu na mi shikera maoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">unone ka mu kinine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">tu na mimbera membo o pa thsidiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">napo karo ka mu dirire makuano.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />“Johani Mukwakukorovethza wa keyire ko kukana ku dya makende nji ku nwa waine, unone mwaa amba ci: ‘O di no mupepo oumango.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana Munu wa keyire no ku dya no ku nwa, karo mwaa amba ci: ‘Oyo dyakudya karo thsitakwa, mbusha waterithsi nanu wevi.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Unone onyanyami wa Nyambi waa monahara ci uwawa kowa na u tambura wahe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuyama o thsivi aa wethsa maathzi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mufarithsi yumweya wethsire Yesu ku ka dya nenthzi ku nthzio thzenthzi. Yesu wa thzire ku nthzio thzoyo Mufarithsi no ku kekara ku tafure ku dya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Omo mu diumbo kwekarire mbuyama o thsivi. Ou a yuvire ci Yesu mu nthzio thzoyo Mufarithsi a di, wa keyire no kakeka kenthzi ko alabasitere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alabasitere po thsa kupitura eci kakeka.</char></note> ko thsende. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Wa nekarire ku mauru a Yesu o ku dira. Mihothzi thzenthzi thzorithsire edyato ya Yesu. Ngou a i pororire no huki thzenthzi no ku i yamwa no ku i wethsa thsende.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Oya Mufarithsi wa raire Yesu ou a i monine wa ambire mu mucima ci: “Oyu munu nga mukwakukethza, nga na dimuka ci oyu mbuyama ne munu o ngepi oyu mu kwatakwata ku mauru, inene munu o thsivi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Simoni, ni ku tongwereko thsinu thsimweya?” Simoni wa mu tawire ci: “Murongithsi, o ni tongwere.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Munu yumweya wa korotithsire anu aidi madi. O kutanga wa korotire dikumi dyo makumi mutanu o madi (500),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dimadi dyofoci shime dya kwamiwerangire diyuwa mutumbi.</char></note> o muthsidi makumi o mutanu (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ou a kwangire ku futura makongo, thsinda thsa madi wa wa amberire ci a ku futura aya madi momu widi wo. Powa anu aidi ne edye oyu wa ku shima nene oya munu?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni wa tawire ci: “Naa anekera ci oya na teteriwa makongo oakuru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu wa ambire ci: “O na tawa nawa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yesu wa thsiurukerire koya mbuyama no ku ambera Simoni ci: “O na mu mono oyu mbuyama? Ni na keya mu nthzio thzoe, ko ni pire meyu o ku cihupa kwidyato yange, unone aye o na hupu edyato yange ko mihothzi thzenthzi no ku i porora no huki thzenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ko ni vumenenine ko ku ni yamwa, unone aye ka a thsiire ku yamwa edyato yange shimbi ni nengenena muno. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ko ni wethsire thsende ku mutwi, unone aye o na ni wethse thsende kwidyato. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Naa ku ambera ci thsishimo thsenthzi thsothsikuru ethsi a na monithsa thsaa pa ombangi ci evi yenthzi yoingi i na teteriwa. Unone o ku teteriwa yoipu aa monithsa thsishimo thsothsipu karo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu wa amberire oya mbuyama ci: “Evi yoe i na teteriwa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Awa a dire nenthzi a tatekire ku cipaura mu kaciko ci: “Oyu ne edye, o ku tetera evi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Unone Yesu wa amberire oyo mbuyama ci: “Thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku yoyithsa, o thze mu thsiyaro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Ambuyama awa na endauranga na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Munyima thzeyo, Yesu wa thzire o pita mu mambongi no mu maumbo o ku thza o honga anu Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi. Wa thzire no tunganda twenthzi to dikumi na twidi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />nambuyama amweya awa porithsiwire ku mathzimu nekora. Awo ambuyama po nedi Madiya Magadalena oyu wa tundithsiwire mathzimu o mutanu na edi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Joana munu wa Kuza muendithsi o rufumo rwa Heroda, no Susana nambuyama amweya owangi awa na kwathsanga Yesu nerongwa yenthzi keyi nekaranga nayo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mukwakukuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Mbunga thzothzikuru thza keyire kwa Yesu, anu awa tundire mu diumbo no diumbo. Wa wa terire kathsimo ko mukwakukuna ci: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Njimi wa thzire ku ka kuna mbuto thzenthzi. O ku kuhera mbuto mu dikanda, thzimweya thza wererire mu dikuñwa, omu thza dyatadyatiwerire kwanu no ku diwa kwinyunyi. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Thzimweya athzopo thzi wera pa muve o mawe. Thza menine no ku kura, unone thza rerire, inene ka pekarire oshuwi nawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Mbuto thzimweya thza wererire mu makona, unone makona ou a kurire a fithsire ekuniwa dinthzombwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Thzimweya karo thza wererire pa muve o wiro. Thza menine, dimbuto no dimbuto dyemine ima yo makumi o dikumi kupita eyi ya kuniwire.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa ambire ci: “Oyu di no matwi o ku yuvithsa, a yuve.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi na a kwamithseranga tuthsimo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Erongwa yenthzi ya mwipurire eyi ka na amba ako kathsimo. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Wa wa tawire ci: “Amwe po mu na piwa ku yuvithsithsa diano dyo Kutumina kwa Nyambi. Unone naa cikwathsithsanga tuthsimo ku rongithsa amweya ci i citombore no Mañoro o ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“ ‘Tuhu a mona, kadi akwa ku monithsithsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">tuhu a yuva, kadi akwa ku yuvithsithsa.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6.9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tongonona kathsimo ko mukwakukuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Eyi po yodiyo ka na amba aka kathsimo, Mbuto po diywi dya Nyambi! <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mbuto ethzi thza wererire mu dikuñwa thzaa cipitura eci anu awa a na yuvu diywi dya Nyambi, unone shamaonga aa keya ku na di wa tundithsa mu micima thzo no ku wa kwangithsa ku tawa no ku yoyithsiwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbuto ethzi thza wererire pa muve o mawe, thzaa cipitura eci anu awa a na yuvu diywi dya Nyambi no ku di tambura ko thsinyanyu, unone ka di no mithzithzi. Aa tawa thsikati thsothsipu, unone mwikati yeereka aa wa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Mbuto ethzi thza wererire mu makona thzaa cipitura eci awaya a na yuvu diywi dya Nyambi, unone kecoyoka, no ku fota nene rufumo necikora yo kaye, diywi dyaa fa oku di shime kwima. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Unone mbuto ethzi thza wererire pa muve o wiro thzaa cipitura eci anushemwa akwa micima thzo thziwa, aa yuva diywi dya Nyambi no ku di tanarithsa, karo kothzui wo aema ima yoingi.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko kambarambara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Kwithsa munu o ku muneka kambarambara no ku ka furumeka kafuma nji ku ka paka mushi thzodidi. Unone aa ka paka pa thsimeko ci awa engena a mone mwethzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwithsa ethsi thsi na horekiwa ethsi mbo thsi kana ku hokoriwa, nji ethsi thsi na thzindiwa ethsi mbo thsi kana ku dimukiwa no ku retiwa mu mwethzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Mu teerere nawa ko i mu yuva, inene oyu di nethsi thsimweya kenge a ku piwa, unone oyu na piri kenge a ku nyangiwa nethsi a na anekera ci o di nathso.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mama wa Yesu namina Yesu wakwerume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Mama wa Yesu namina Yesu a keyire ci na mu mone, unone a kwangire ku kuma ku kwenthzi mukaci ko mbunga. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Munu yumweya wa mu tongwerire ci: “Njinoe naminoe pora a di aa fota ku ku mona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Mama wange naminange po anu awa a yuva diywi dya Nyambi no ku di hengeka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tutwarithsa dyungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Tu yavukerenu mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya.” A yomamine mu wato no ku hunyuna. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />O kwa vua kengeyo, Yesu wa thzire pa turo. Kwa keyire dyungu dyodikuru o kwa di omo mu diviya, ekarire mukaru o ku fota ku rowera, inene mañithsingi a yarithsire meyu mu wato.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Erongwa ya keyire kwa Yesu no ku mu pindura ci: “Ñathsire wetu, Ñathsire wetu, twaa fa!” Wa pindukire no ku kuturura mupepo no mañithsingi. Ko wanguwangu dyungu dya pwire akopo ku onga. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Wepurire erongwa ci: “Thsitawo thsenu ne kupi thsi di?” Erongwa ya yapire nene no ku komoka no ku cipaura ci: “Oyu munu ne munu o ngepi? Aa tumina mipepo no meyu, karo yaa mu yuvera.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerume o mathzimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />A ka thsekerire mu ditunga dya Geraseni oshungashunga na Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu ou a shamukerire pa dikambo, wa mu hanganyekire mukwerume oyu wa tundire mu diumbo oyu wekarire no mathzimu. Wa shimbire thsikati thsothsire kadi wa ku vata evata, karo ka na ekaranga mu nthzio shime ku mararo.<verse eid="LUK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ou a monine Yesu, wa tetumukire no ku na wera ku rupara rwenthzi, no ku karumuka ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Ine eyi fota ku kwange owe o Mwana Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene? Naa ku romba wa ni nyandithsa!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Wa ambire kengeyo, inene Yesu wa tuminine uya mupepo oumango ci u tunde ku kwenthzi. Ou mupepo oumango wa mu shimbire kare karo shaanga ou a mu nyungangire ko ku mwanganga no madyenge no mawaya ku mauru, wa i cinunangire, mupepo oumango no ku mu twara mu dikunguthsitu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Yowe odye dithzina dyoe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Aye wa tawire ci: “Yame no Mungi.” Wa ambire kengeyo inene wekarire no mathzimu oangi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mathzimu a hukahukerire ku adikanena Yesu ci a a cithzera mu dikwina dyo kupira ondanda.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kwekarire mutanga oukuru o nguru ou wa dyererire pa mukinya. Ao mathzimu a adikanenine Yesu ci a a tawethze ku kengena mwethzo nguru. Yesu wa a tawethzire. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mathzimu a tundire koya munu no ku kengena mwethzo nguru, mutanga ouhe wa rundumukire pa muurumuko ku cirera mu diviya no ku ka feramo ku meyu.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Awa thzi futithsire ou a monine eyi ya tendaharire, a cirire no ku ka tongaura mu mbongi no mu mandau amweya. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Anu a thzire ku ka cimonena eyi ya tendaharire. A keyire kwa Yesu no ku na wana oya munu a tundithsire mathzimu o ku nekara ku mauru a Yesu, o ku na vata nawa no maano o ku a di nawa. A yapire nene, <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />awa a i monine a wa tongawerire edi a porithsiwire oya mukwerume o mathzimu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Anu wahe o mu ditunga dya Geraseni a rombire Yesu ci a tunde mu ditunga dyo, inene eyi a kwamine ya wa tutukwithsire. Yesu wa yomamine mu wato ku huka oku a tundire.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Oya munu a tundithsire mathzimu wa rombire ci a thze naye na Yesu. Unone Yesu wa mu kanithsire ci: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“O thze ku diumbo dyoe kwapoe o ka wa tongwere enu yoshokuru eyi a na ku kwamena Nyambi.” Oyo mukwerume wa thzire mu maumbo oahe ku ka tongaura enu yoikuru eyi a mu kwamenine Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa anu ko thsitawo thso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu ou a ka tundire mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya, thza na mu tamburire mbunga thzothzikuru, inene wahe shime a mu tatererire. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Mukwerume o dithzina dyo Jairosi wa kumine naye, oyu wekarire muendithsi o sinagoge. Wa na wererire ku mauru a Yesu no ku mu romba ci a thze ku nthzio thzenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Wekarire no mwanenthzi yofoci pakamutwa o mbuyamaana, o myaka thzo dikumi na thzidi, oyu wa kokangerire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu o ku di mu dikuñwa dyo ku thzako, mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu thsindakanithsire. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Kwekarire mbuyama oyu wa korire diropa myaka thzo dikumi na thzidi, enu yenthzi yoihe ya shandukire kwakwakupanga owangi, unone kwithsa oyu wa twethsire ku mu porithsa kweyo ekora yenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Wa keyire ku muongo wa Yesu no ku na kwata ku munganja o thsikoveyo thsenthzi. Mwethso thsikati, diropa dyenthzi dyemanine.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Edye na ni kwata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Wahe a hamurire, unone Peturu wa ambire ci: “Ñathsire wange, mu kaci ko mbunga o di, ka piri ku ku kunyuna.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Kwaa di oyu na ni kwata, inene ni na yuvu okoro wange o ku porithsa o ku u ni tunda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Oya mbuyama ou a monine ci ka i tawa ku cihoreka, wa keyire o tutuma no ku na tongama ku mauru a Yesu no ku na tongaura thsitonwameho ku mbunga eyi a kwaterire ku thsikoveyo thsa Yesu nedi a porire wanguwangu. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Mwanange thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku porithsa, o thze mu thsiyaro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ou a ambire yoyihe eyo, munu oyu wa tundire ku nthzio thza Jairosi muendithsi o sinagoge wa na kumine no ku na mu tongwera ci: “Mwanoe o na nyanda, kwithsa eyi o cakanithsera murongithsi karo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Unone Yesu wa i yuvire o ku i ambera Jairosi. Wa mu amberire ci: “Jairosi wa yapa, o tawe pohuma, mwanoe kenge a pora.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ou a ka kumine kuya ku nthzio wa ka kanithsire anu wahe kwingena nenthzi mu nthzio shime Peturu, Johani na Jakovo no tata wa mwanuke no mama wa mwanuke. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Anu wahe o kwa dira makuano, Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mwa dira, oyu mwanuke ka a fire aa rara pohuma.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Anu a teururire Yesu awo pa ku dimuka ci o na fu shemwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu wa kwatire ku dyoko dyoya mwanuke no ku amba ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Owe mwanuke, o pinduke.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Wa pwethzumukire no ku pinduka wangu. Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu mu pe edya a dye.” <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ashemienthzi a komokire nene, unone Yesu wa wa koñomekire ci a tongwera munu shaanga yofoci eyi i na tendahara.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tuma tunganda to dikumi na twidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu wethsire tunganda twenthzi to dikumi na twidi, wa tu pire okoro o ku cithza mathzimu no ku porithsa ekora. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Karo wa wa tumine ku ka honga yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi no ku ka porithsa akwakukora. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Omu mu ruendo, mwa shimba muramu o ku endera, mukotana, ñuta thzedya nji thzo madi, nji ku shimba ekoveyo idi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Mu mwanda momuhe omu mwa ku ka tamburiwa, mwa ku kekaremo shime ku ka kuma mu diyuwa edi mwa ku tundamo ku thza kumweya. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Omu a ku ka kana ku mi tambura momuhe mwa ku ka tunde mu diumbo dyo no ku kukumuna dikungu kwidyato yenu ci ikare ombangi ou wa ku wa wemeka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Tunganda twa thzire mu maumbo oahe o kwa thza o honga Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi karo a porithsire akwakukora kokuhe oku a thzire.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Heroda aa karupera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Heroda fumu o mu Galilea ou a yuvire yoihe eyi ya tendaharire wa karuperire, inene amweya shime a ningire ci Johani na pinduka kwafu. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Amweya ci Eliya o na ka huka, amweya ci Mukwakukethza yumweya o kukare yo na pinduka kwafu. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Unone Heroda wa ningire ci: “Johani po na mu tetire mutwi, edye karo oyu ni yuva yenthzi?” Ngou a fotire ku mona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa pa edya anu o 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Tunganda twa ka hukire no ku na tongawera Yesu eyi a ka kwamine yoihe. Wa wa shimbire no ku thzano wafoci mu diumbo dya Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Unone anu wahe ou a dimukire kengeyo, a mu shupwerire. Yesu wa wa tamburire no ku wa rongithsa yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi no kuporithsa awa korire.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Diyuwa ou dya ombokire, erongwa yo dikumi na idi ya keyire kwa Yesu no ku na ninga ci: “O tongwere anu a cithzere mu maumbo no mu tuumboana a ka cifotere edya noku ko ku rara, inene muno tu di po mu murundu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Unone Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu wa pe edya yo yamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Awo a tawire ci: “Ka tu di nedya shime makende o mutanu no thsi thzidi, nji waa fota ci tu wa urere edya wahe awa?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Mwethzo mbunga mwekarire akwerume o ku fota ku kwana 5,000.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mu wekarithse kekwata yanu o ku fota ku kwana makumi mutanu, thsikwata no thsikwata.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Erongwa ya tendire kengeyo a wekarithsire wahe. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu wa shimbire ao makende o mutanu nethzo thsi thzidi, wa diamenine ku wiru no ku kanderera, wa i kuyaurire no ku i pa erongwa yenthzi ci i ere mbunga. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Wahe a dire no kwikuta. Erongwa ya yarithsire mayongo o dikumi na edi omwamwaethzi ou wa thsiarirepo.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa amba ci Yesu po yodiyo Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Thsikati thsimweya Yesu ou a romberire ko kumengi, wekarire pohuma nerongwa yenthzi. Wa ipurire ci: “Ene anu ne aa ninga ci yame nodye?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Ya mu tawire ci: “Amweya aa ninga ci Johani Mukwakukorovethza, amweya ci Eliya, amweya karo ci o yumweya wakwakukethza o kukare oyu na pinduka kwafu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Wa ipurire ci: “Amwe ne mwaa ninga ci yame nodye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Peturu wa tawire ci: “Yowe o Mesiya wa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba yo kufa no kupinduka kwenthzi kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar 8.30—9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu wa i koñomekire ci katere i i tongwere munu. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Wa ambire ci: “Mwana Munu aa roera ku nyandithsiwa nene no ku kaniwa kwaendithsi o mbunga, akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao. Karo aa roera ku paiwa no ku pinduka kwafu mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Wa ambire ku mbunga ci: “Munu o ku fota kwikara thsirongwa thsange, a shuve mwoyo wenthzi, a shimbe mbinda thzenthzi diyuwa no diyuwa no ku ni shupwera. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Inene ngeci owepo fota nene mwoyo woe, kenge wa ku u yawa. Unone yoihe o shuva mwoyo woe mukaci kange, kenge wa ku u yoyithsa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Owa wine o ku fuma kaye kokahe, unone waa yawa mwoyo nji owe kwipithsiwa? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />O ku fera honyi ame no maywi ange, Mwana Munu naye kenge mba a mu fera honyi ou mba a ka huka mu kutethzima kwenthzi no mu kutethzima kwa Tata noku ko tungeru totukenu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci amweya awa a di pano ka ku fa o kwa shime ku mona Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa piruka no ku monahara kutethzima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Munyima thzo mayuwa o mutanu na ahatu, Yesu wa shimbire Peturu, Johani na Jakovo ku thzano pa mukinya ku ka rombera. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />O ku rombera kengeyo, mumonaharero o rupara rwenthzi wa pirukire, nevata yenthzi ya monaharire kuvyakima. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Popo akwerume aidi, Eliya na Mushe a monaharire no ku tateka ku ambaura nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />A monaharire mu kutethzima no ku tateka ku ambaura yo ku thza kwenthzi ku kufa oku kwekarire po pepi no ku citombora mu Yerusalema.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Peturu nowa ekarireno a thzire pa turo. Ou a pindukire, a monine kutethzima kwa Yesu nakwerume aidi o kwa nemana nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Awo anu aidi o kwa thza, Peturu wa amberire Yesu ci: “Ñathsire wange, i na roo eyi tu di kuno, tu kwame matunu ahatu, dimweya dyoe, dimweya dya Mushe, dimweya dya Eliya.” Ka a dimukire eyi a ambire.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />O ku amba kengeyo kwa keyire divui no ku wa thsika, a yapire ou engenine omo mu divui.<verse eid="LUK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Diywi dya tundire mu divui ku amba ci: “Oyu po Mwanange oyu na ni hangura, mu mu yuvere.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ou dya manine ku amba edyo diywi, Yesu wa thsiarire yofoci. Erongwa ya thzindire eyi, ka ya tongwerire munu mo aya mayuwa eyi ya monine.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerumeana o mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Yesu nerongwa yenthzi ihatu o kwa na ka tunda pa mukinya, mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu shambawerire. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Popo mukwerume mu kaci ko mbunga wa kumbire ci: “Murongithsi, naa ku romba o yuvere ñeke mwanange o mukwerumeana, yodiyo mwanange yofoci pakamutwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mupepo oumango waa mwingenanga no ku mu karumukithsa no ku mu withseranga pashi eci wa thsinyonya. Karo waa mu tupurithsanga kafuthzi no ku mu hanyahanyithsa. Waa mu nyandithsanga, karo ka u mu thsiangire wangu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ni na rombo erongwa yoe ci i u cithze, unone i na u kwanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Amwe mwanu o kupira thsitawo nanu wetenda yoimango, kenge na kwikara nenu thsikati thso ku kuma kupi ci ni mi kunde? O rete mwanoe kuno.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Oyo mukwerumeana o ku keya, mupepo oumango wa mu huwerire pashi no ku mu hanyahanyithsa nene. Unone Yesu wa u kutururire no ku mu porithsa, no ku mu huthsa kwa tata wenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Anu wahe ou a monine eyo, a komokire okoro wa Nyambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu aa amba ro muthsidi yo kufa kwenthzi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Anu wahe o kwa komoka enu yoihe eyi a kwamine Yesu, aye wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mu teerere nawa eyi ni mi tongwera pano! Mwana Munu tamba ku piwa mu moko akwethzimbo yenthzi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Unone ayo ka ya yuvithsithsire eyi a ambire, inene ya horekiwire ku kwayo ci ya i yuvithsithsa, unone ya yapire ku i mwipura.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O mukuru ne edye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Kwekarire dikanyi mu kaci kerongwa kuninga ci, o mukuru mu kaciko ne edye. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu wa dimukire eanekera yo, waa shimbire kanuke no ku na kemeka ku nyonga thzenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Munu yomuhe o ku tambura aka kanuke mu dithzina dyange, yame a na tambura. Noyu o ku ni tambura aa tambura oyu naa ni tumu. Yomuhe o ku cihuthsa kushi ku kwenu mwahe yodiyo o mukuru.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O kukana ku mi rwithsa aa mimanena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mar 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Johani wa ambire ci: “Ñathsire wange, tu na mono mukwerume o ku cithza mupepo oumango mu dithzina dyoe, o tu na mu kanithsa, inene kadi wa mu thsipani thsetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Mwa mu kanithsa, inene o kukana ku mi rwithsa aa mi manena.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu o mu diumbo dyo mu Samaria aa kana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Mayuwa enthzi o ku huka ku wiru ou a henyenine po showipi, Yesu wa manenenine eanekera yenthzi yo ku thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Wa tumine tunganda ku rupara rwenthzi, awa thzire mu diumbo dyo mu Samaria ci a ka mu roithsere enu yoihe. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Unone omo mu diumbo ka ka mu tamburire, pakuninga ci shime a thzire ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Erongwa yenthzi a Jakovo na Johani ou a i monine, a ambire ci: “Fumu, ene tu tumine mudiro u tunde ku wiru u keye na u wa ñotore?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu wa cithsetukire no ku i wa kuturura. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Mweyo, a tuturukerire mu diumbo dimweya.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyo ku shupwera Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />O kwa enda kengeyo mu mukwakwa, munu yumweya wa mu amberire ci: “Kenge ni thza noe kokuhe oku o thza.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Mbwawa thzi di no mateke, nenyunyi i di no mataratara, uno honi Mwana Munu aye ka a di no nthzio thzo ku rara.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Wa amberire mukwerume yumweya ci: “O ni shupwere.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Aye wa mu tawire ci: “Fumu, o ni tawethze ni thze tango ni ka vumbeke tata.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu ngou a mu amberire ci: “O thsie afu a vumbeke aenthzo afu. Uno honi owe po o thze no ku honga yo Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Yumweya karo wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, naa fota ku thza noe, unone o ni tawethze tango ni ka rae ku diumbo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Kwithsa munu o ku cithsetukanga o ku purura o ku roera mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tuma erongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Munyima thzeyo, Fumu ayepo hangura erongwa imweya yo makumi mutanu na edi nerongwa idi no ku wa tuma aidi aidi ku citangethza mu maumbo no mandau amweya aa a fotire ku hungerithsa. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Ayepo i ambera ci: “Dicora po dikuru, unone akwakucora apu. Mweyo, mu rombe kwa Fumu o dicora ci a tume akwakucora owangi mu dikanda dyenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mu thze, naa mi tuma eci mangu mu kaci ko winthzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mwa shimba thsipaupau, mukotana nji mashangu, karo mwemana mu dikuñwa ku vumenena munu.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />“O ku mwingena mu mwanda, mu ambe tango ci: ‘Thsiyaro thsa Nyambi thsikare nenu muno mu mwanda.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ngeci mwaa di munu o ku fota thsiyaro, thsiyaro thsenu kenge thsikara nenthzi. Unone ngeci mwithsa, kenge thsi mi hukera. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mwikare omo mu mwanda, mu dye no ku nwa eyi a mi pa yoihe, inene ngamba aa roera ku piwa ethsi a na kwamena. Mwa endaura mu myanda thzimweya, mwikare pofoci.”<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />“Ngeci mwa engena mu diumbo, karo awopo a mi tambura ko moko edi, mu ka dye yoihe eyi a mi yumbura. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mu porithse akwakukora awa a dimo no ku wa tongwera ci Kutumina kwa Nyambi pepi ku di nenu. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Unone kamona mu kuma mu diumbo omu a na kana ku mi tambura, mu thze mu makuñwa mu wa tongwere kuninga ci: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Twaa mi kukumwena dikungu dyo diumbo dyenu edi di na tu rambera kwidyato, ku mi monithsa ci Nyambi kenge a ku mi pa murandu, shaanga kengeyo, mu dimuke ci Kutumina kwa Nyambi pepi ku di.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci mu diyuwa dyo raturo kenge kwa kwikara tangonaho ku Sodoma kupita edyo diumbo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maumbo aa a kanine ku tawa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwakwa Korazini na Betisaida, inene ekomokithsa eyi na i kwamiwa mu matunga enu nga mu Sidoni na Tire, nga na cere kare no ku vata mathsaka no ku ciwethsa mututwi ku monithsa ku cera evi yo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Shaanga kengeyo, mu diyuwa dyo raturo kenge ya kwikara tangonaho ku Tire na Sidoni kupita amwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Owe o Kapenauma ne, ene waa anekera ci kenge wa ku thzinekiwa ku wiru nji? Dyombo, kenge wa ku huweriwa pashi apa di afu!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Ayepo ambera erongwa yenthzi ci: “O ku mi yuvera aa ni yuvera name, o ku mi kana aa ni kana name, o ku ni kana aa kana noyu naa ni tumu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awaya o makumi mutanu na edi nanu aidi aa ka huka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Awa o makumi mutanu na edi nanu aidi (72) ou a ka hukire a nyanyukire nene no ku amba ci: “Fumu, shaanga mathzimu aa cihuthsa kushi thzetu yoihe tu kwamithsa dithzina dyoe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Wa tawire ci: “Shime naa mona Satana o ku wa ku wiru eci kwethsa ko mvura. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mu teerere, na ni mi pa okoro o ku dyata mayoka no nge, karo no peuru thzokoro ouhe wa mukwathsithzimbo, kwithsa ethsi nga thsi mi kurura. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Mwa nyanyuka pakuninga ci mathzimu aa cihuthsa kushi thzenu. Unone mu nyanyuke nene pa ku dimuka ci mathzina enu a na ñoriwa mu wiru.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsinyanyu thsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Kethsiya thsikati, Yesu wa yarire thsinyanyu ko Mupepo Oukenu, no ku amba ci: “Naa ku shangara Tata, Fumu o diwiru no kaye, naa kanderera ku koe pa ku horeka eyi enu kowa owanyanyami nakwakucirongithsa, no ku i hokora kowa o kuninga eci anuke owaonye. Ii, Tata, no kwama kengeyo, inene modiyo no fotera.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tata na a paka enu yoihe mu moko ange, kwithsa oyu na dimuka ci mwana ne edye, shime Tata pohuma, karo kwithsa oyu na dimuka ci Tata ne edye, shime Mwana nowa na a hangura Mwana ku mu hokora kukwo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yesu wa thsiurukerire kwirongwa yenthzi no ku i ambera ku mukunda ci: “A thsiyauthzi meho o ku mona eyi mu na mono! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Naa mi ambera ci akwakukethza no mafumu oangi a fotire ci nga a na mono eyi mu mona, unone ka i monine; no ku yuva eyi mu yuva, unone ka i yuvire.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musamaria o muwawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Mukwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda wemanine ko ku ereka Yesu no kwipura ci: “Murongithsi,” “Ine eyi ni na roera ku tenda ci ni wane mwoyo o diyere?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Ine eyi i na ñoriwa mu murao? Waa taramo ine?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Aye wa tawire ci: “O shime Fumu Nyambi woe ko mucima woe ouhe, ko mwoyo woe ouhe, kokoro woe ouhe, ko maano oe oahe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Mali 19.18</ref>.</char></note> no ku shima muenthzoe eci edi wa cishima othsinda.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Mura 6.5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O na tawa nawa, o tende kengeyo ci wa ku yoye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ko ku fota ku cimonithsa ci muwawa, wepurire Yesu ci: “Muenthzange ne edye?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Munu yumweya wa urumukire ku tunda ku Yerusalema ku thza ku Jeriko awopo a mu kweceka ethzi. A mu shupurire evata yenthzi no ku mu fura shime ku fota ku fa, no ku mu thsia.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />“Mupurisita wa endire mwedyo dikuñwa, ou a mu monine wa mu kondorokire. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mulivi naye wa endire mwedyo dikuñwa, ou a mu monine wa mu kondorokire.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />“Unone kwa keyire Musamaria oyu wa endire ruendo. Ou a mu monine wa mu yuverire ñekeñeke. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Wa mu henyenine no ku yoa peronda yenthzi no maathzi no waine, wa mu thzingirepo eto no ku mu paka pa thsindongi thsenthzi. Wa mu twarire ku nthzio thzenda oku a ka mu nyungerire. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Anaci mathsiku wa pire thsinda thsa nthzio miwayawaya thzidi thzo silivera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miwayawaya thzidi thzo madinari po nedi madi o ku kwamena mayuwa edi.</char></note> Wa mu amberire ci: ‘Mu u ni nyungere oyu munu. Ou na ku ka huka kenge na ku na ku kura yoihe eyi ya ku civungithsapo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu wepurire oyo mukwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda ci: “Edye kwawo anu ahatu oyu o na anekera ci yo muenthza oya munu a kwecekire ethzi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Wa mu tawire ci: “Oyu na mu yuvera ñeke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu ayepo mu ambera ci: “O thze nowe o ka tende kengeyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hungerithsa Mareta na Madiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi o kwa di mu ruendo rwo ro ku thza ku Yerusalema, wa pitire mu diumbo dimweya omu mwekarire mbuyama oyu wethsiwire Mareta, wa mu tamburire nawa mu mwanda wenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Wekarire no minenthzi o dithzina dyo Madiya, oyu wekarire ku mauru a Fumu o ku teerera eyi a rongithsire. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Unone Mareta shime a vendanine nene kekwama eyi a kwamine. Wa keyire kwa Yesu no ku na amba ci: “Fumu, eyi ne iwa ci minange a ni thsiere ekwama nofoci? O mu tongwere ci naa ni kwamithseko.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Fumu wa mu tawire ci: “Mareta, Mareta, waa cithzekera no ku shupeka kenu yoingi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />unone ethsi thsi na fotiwa po thsofoci pohuma. Madiya po na hangura thsinu thsothsiwa karo mbera ka mba a thsi nyangiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rongithsa erongwa yenthzi dyo ku rombera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu shime a romberire mu ndau thzimweya. Ou a manine, thsimweya kwirongwa yenthzi thsa ambire ci: “Fumu, o tu rongithse ku rombera eci Johani edi a rongithsire erongwa yenthzi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Wa i amberire ci: “O ku mu rombera, mu ambe kenge ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“ ‘Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">dithzina dyoe di hengekiwe dyodikenu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Kutumina koe kwiye.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />O tu pe diyuwa no diyuwa edya yetu yo diyuwa no diyuwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />O tu tetere evi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">inene natwe twaa teteranga akwamirandu thzetu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Karo wa tu twara mwitumaura.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Wa ambire karo ci: “Tu fekithse kenge ci munu aa thza ku nthzio thza mbushenthzi pa kaci kothsiku no ku ka amba ci: ‘Mbusha, o ni korotithseko manganja ahatu oshunga, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />inene na ni turera mbusha oyu di mu ruendo, unone ka ni di neyi yo ku mu yumbura.’<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />“Karo tu fekithse kenge ci oya di muya mu nthzio aa tawa ci: ‘Wa ni shupa. Ni na pata ku thsero no ku rara ni na rara nanange owaonye. Ka ni twethse ku pinduka ku na ku pa eyi o fota.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Naa mi ambera ci shaanga ka a fotire ku pinduka ci na a mu pe eyi a na foto pakuninga ci mbushenthzi, kenge a pinduka ku na mu pa eyi a na foto mukaci ko muooto wenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci: Mu rombe kenge mwa ku piwa, mu fote kenge mwa ku wana, mu ngongomone kenge mwa ku yanthzurweriwera. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Inene munu yomuhe o ku romba aa piwa, o ku fota aa wana, karo o ku ngongomona aa yanthzurweriwera.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />“Ene kwaa di ku kwenu mwashemi, o ku pa mwanenthzi diyoka o ku na rombo ethsi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nji ku mu pa nge o ku na rombo diyaki? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ngeci honi amwe mwanu owamango mwaa dimuka ku pa anenu epa yoiwa, aye Tata wenu o ku wiru ne kwa ku kuma kupi kupa o ku a ku pa Mupepo Oukenu kowa a na mu rombo!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu no ñathsire o mathzimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mar 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu wa cithzire mupepo oumango kwa mukwerume o shiamba. Ou wa mu tundire wa tatekire ku amba, mbunga thza komokire. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Unone anu amweya a ambire ci: “Aa cithza mathzimu kokoro wa Beelezebule, ñathsire o mathzimu.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Amweya a erekire Yesu ko ku mu romba ci a wa monithse thsimonithso thso ku tunda ku wiru, ci a rakwe ci ya shemwa Mwana Nyambi.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Aye wa dimukire eanekera yo, waa wa amberire ci: “Kutumina ko ku cia ko ku cirwithsa kenge kwa kwipa, no mwanda o kwikareranga ku cirwithsa kenge wa ku citepa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ngeci Satana aa citepa yothsinda ne, ngepi nga ku tanara kutumina kwenthzi? Naa amba kengeyo, inene mwaa amba ci naa cithza mathzimu kokoro wa Beelezebule. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Ngeci ame naa cithza mathzimu kokoro wa Beelezebule ne, awa anuenu ne aa cithza mathzimu kokoro o ku tunda kupi? Kenge a ku mi ratura keyi mu na amba. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Uno honi ngeci naa cithza mathzimu kokoro wa Nyambi, Kutumina kwa Nyambi ku na kumu ku kwenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Munu o mukoro oyu na kwaterera erwithsa yenthzi ku nyunga nthzio thzenthzi, etenga yenthzi yoihe yaekara nawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Unone o mukoro ku mu pita yoihe a mu rwithsa no ku mu othza, aa mu nyanga erwithsa yenthzi eyi a na kurupera no ku tapera eyi a na pukura.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Yomuhe o kukana ku nimanena aa ni rwithsa, noyu o kukana kungera nange aa shandura.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukahuka ko mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yesu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Mupepo oumango yoihe u tunda kwa munu, waa thza mu dikunguthsitu ku ka fota ko ku turumwithsera. Unone o ku u na kana ku wana mo ku turumwithsera waa amba ci: ‘Naa huka mu nthzio omu na ni tundu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Yoihe u ka huka no ku na wana nthzio ci thzi na kombiwa no ku roithsiwa nawa, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />waa thza ku ka shimba mipepo thzimweya thzo mutanu na thzidi thzothzimango nene ku u pita. Thzothzihe thzaa keya no ku na tungamo, ku hura oya munu kenge a kwipa kupita pa kutanga.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwikara no thsiyauthzi shemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu o ku amba eyi, mbuyama mu mbunga wa tumukire ku amba ci: “Wa thsiyauthzi mbuyama oyu wa kwerekire no ku ku yamwithsa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ii, unone awa di nene no thsiyauthzi po awa na yuvu diywi dya Nyambi no ku di hengeka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsimonithso thso ku tunda kwa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Yesu o ku thzi na mu umbu mbunga wa ambire ci: “Amwe mwanu o rerodino po mwamango, mwaa fota thsimonithso thso ku tunda kwa Nyambi. Unone ka mwa ku thsi mona shime thsimonithso thsa Jonasi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Dyodi ekarire Jonasi thsimonithso thsAkwaNinive, no Mwana Munu dya a kwikara thsimonithso kwanu o rerodino.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />“Mu diyuwa dyo raturo, Fumu o mbuyama o ku mboera kenge a kwimana ku ratura anu o rerodino. Wa tundire ku hura o kaye ku na yuva erongithsa yonyanyami wa Solomoni, unone o mukuru kupita Solomoni pa a di pano. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mu diyuwa dyo raturo AkwaNinive kenge a kwimana no ku ratura anu o rerodino. Inene a cerire omango wo ou a yuvire erongithsa ya Jonasi. Uno honi pano po paa di o mukuru kupita Jonasi, unone mwaa kana ku teerera ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwethzi no mirema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Kwithsa munu o ku muneka kambarambara no ku ka horeka nji ku ka furumeka kafuma, unone aa ka paka pa thsimeko ci awa engena a mone mwethzi. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Dithziho dyoe po odiyo mumunyi werama yoe. Dithziho yoihe di mona nawa, erama yoe yoihe yaekara mu mwethzi. Unone dithziho dyoe ngeci ka di monine nawa, erama yoe yoihe yaekara mu mirema. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Uno honi o mamere ci ou mwethzi u di ku koe wekara mirema. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Mweyo, ngeci erama yoe yoihe mu mwethzi i di ko kupira thsirama ethsi thsi di mu mirema, erama yoe kenge ya kwikara mu mwethzi pohuma eci kambarambara aka ka muneka pa poe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa shomorora Afarithsi narongithsi o murao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba, Mufarithsi yumweya wa mwithsire ci a ka dye nenthzi. Wa thzire no ku kekara ku tafure. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Unone Mufarithsi wa komokire ou a monine Yesu o ku dya ko kukana ku ciyoa ku moko.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Fumu wa mu amberire ci: “Amwe mwAfarithsi namwe dyo mu di, mwaa yoanga turonga no manganja peuru, unone mu kaci ko micima thzenu mu na yara rununa nomango. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Amwe mwanu o kupira maano! Ene oyu Nyambi wa kwamine peuru ne kadi yo wa kwamine no mu kaci nji? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Uno honi mu pe ahepwe eyi i di mu manganja no mu turonga twenu, apo honi enu yoihe kenge ya kwikara yoikenu ku kwenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwAfarithsi, inene mwaa panga Nyambi thso mudikumi kweyi mu na dimanga yo kupitura eci minta, kumini no miroho thzothzihe. Unone mwaa kwanga ku kwama anu nawa no kukana thsishimo thsa Nyambi. Eyi po yodiyo mu na roera ku kwama ko kukana ku thsiererako imweya.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Othsimo po wenu, amwe mwAfarithsi, inene mwaa shimanga kwikara mwipura yo direma mu masinagoge no ku vumeneniwa ko direma mu maurithsero.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Othsimo po wenu, inene mwaa cipitura no idi yo kukana ku makiwa, apa endaura anu ko kukana ku i dimuka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Yumweya kwakwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda wa mu tawire ci: “Fumu, ku amba kengeyo po waa tu tuka natwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Namwe mwakwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda mwakwothsimo, inene mwaa shimbithsa anu mipango thzothziremu ethzi a kwanga ku shimba, unone amwe kadi mwakwa ku kwatako shaanga no kanyehe ci mu wa kwathse.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Mwakwothsimo, inene mwaa umba idi yakwakukethza awa epaiwire kwakwathsañuruenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Yoshemwa mwaa monithsa ci mwaa tawa ekwama yakwathsañuruenu eyi a kwamine. Epaire akwakukethza, unone amwe mwaa umba idi yo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Mukaci keyi, Nyambi konyanyami wenthzi wa ambire ci: ‘Kenge na ku wa tumena akwakukethza no tunganda, kenge a ku nepaa amweya no ku nyandithsa amweya.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Mweyo, anu o rerodino wahe kenge a ku wana murandu o kwipaa akwakukethza a Nyambi, awa epaiwa ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Ku tunda pa kwipaiwa kwa Abele ku na kuma pa kwipaiwa kwa Zakariya oyu epaerire mu kaci ko katara no Tembere. Yoshemwa ou murandu o kwipaiwa kowa anu kenge wa ku huka kwanu o rerodino.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Othsimo po wenu amwe mwakwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda, inene mu na shimbi dipao dyodimukero. Amwe mwaa kana kwingenamo, karo mwaa kwangithsa nowa a fota kwingenamo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu ou a punine omo, arongithsi o murao nAfarithsi a tatekire ku mu rwithsa nene ko ku mwipaura mangudi oangi. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Shime a erekire ku mu ta pa rudimi ci nga a wane yo ku mu capa.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Mu yape Nyambi, mwa yapa anu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ou ya kwamaharire yoihe eyi, tukore na tukore twanu twa ciwanawanine ku ninga ci mane shime aa cidyatadyata ku mauru. Yesu wa amberire tango erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mu mamere mamene Afarithsi, ao mahetaheta o. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kwithsa ethsi thsi na thsikiwa ethsi thsa kukana ku thsikuriwa, kwithsa thso ku horekiwa ethsi thsa kukana ku hokoriwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Mweyo, eyi mu na ambera mu mirema kenge ya ku yuviwa mutenya, eyi mu na yaayera ku mukunda mu tupingwethzi kenge ya ku kuereriwa peuru thzetuwa yo manthzio.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyu mu na roera ku yapa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Naa mi tongwera amwe mwambushange, mwa yapa awo o kwipaa erama, uno honi munyima thzeyo kwithsa karo ethsi nga a twethsa ku kwama thso kupita ethso. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Unone kenge ni mi tongwera oyu mu na roera ku yapa, mu yape Nyambi aye oyu o di nokoro o kwipaa erama no ku i konthzera mu dihere, ii, oyo po yo mu na roera ku yapa. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Kadi tundumbu to mutanu twaa urithsiwa ko tuwayawaya twidi? Unone kwithsa shaanga kofoci ku kwato aka a na vurama Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Shaanga huki thzo ku mitwi thzenu thzi na tariwa. Mweyo, mwa yapa! Amwe po mwaa shimiwa nene kupita tundumbu totungi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kucitawera Yesu nji ku mu hamura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Naa mi tongwera ci munu yomuhe o ku pa ombangi keyi yange pa meho anu, Mwana Munu naye kenge a ku pa ombangi keyi yenthzi pa meho o tungeru twa Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Unone o ku ni hamura pa meho anu kenge mba a hamuriwa pa meho o tungeru twa Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Munu yomuhe o ku amba thsothsimango kwa Mwana Munu kenge a ku teteriwa, unone o ku yengwera Mupepo Oukenu mbera ka a teteriwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Ou a ku mi twara mu masinagoge no ku manguvuru nakwakutumina ku ka mi thzekithsa mwa ku cithzekera omu mwa ku ka citawerera nji eyi mwa ku ka amba. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Inene Mupepo Oukenu kenge a ku mi rongithsa mwethso thsikati eyi mwa ku ka amba yoihe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko fumanyi o mutomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Munu yumweya mu mbunga wa amberire Yesu ci: “Murongithsi, o ambere mukurwange a ni ere ku rufumo oru a thsiire tata.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Shadi, oyu naa ni pa okoro o ku ratura no ku era rufumo ne edye?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mu mamere! Mu cinyunge ku mishovo thzothzihe thzo rununa, inene mwoyo po ka u di mweyi a na fumu munu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Wa shumunineko ko ku wa tera kathsimo ci: “Munu yumweya o fumanyi wekarire no dikanda dyo muve o wiro omu a wanine edya yoingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Wa cipurire yothsinda ci: ‘Ngepi ni tenda? Ka ni di nomu mo ku paka edya yange yoihe.’<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />“Wa ambire ci: ‘Kenge na ku kwama kenge, kenge na ku umburura eshete yo kare no ku umba yoikuru honi, na ku pakemo vuroto wange netere yange yoihe. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Wangu na kwikare pashi no ku ciambera nothsinda ci: “Ame no munu o thsiyauthzi ni di nenu yoingi eyi ya ku shimba myaka thzothzingi kadi ya ku pwa. Ni turumwithse honi, ni dye, ni nwe, ni cikore.” ’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />“Unone Nyambi wa mu amberire ci: ‘Owe thsitomba! Ouno othsiku waa fa, edye oyu o thsiera yoihe eyi no kwama?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu wa manenenine ku amba ci: “Dyo i di no ku munu o ku cungumekera rufumo unone ka a di no rufumo rweyi ya Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa cithzekera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci mwa cithzekera yo mwoyo wenu ci ine mwa ku dya, nji yerama yenu ci ine mwa ku vata. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Inene mwoyo po ukuru mu thsivaka kupita edya, nerama ikuru mu thsivaka kupita evata. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mu mone mañwarara. Ka a dima nji ku cora, ka a wana etaravo nji eshete. Unone Nyambi aa a rera, amwe po mwakuru nene mu thsivaka ku pita enyunyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Edye ku kwenu o ku twethsa ku shumuna shaanga thsitunde thsofoci ku mwoyo wenthzi ko ku cithzekera? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ngeci mwaa kwanga enu yoionye kengeyo, ine yo ku coyokera enu yoshokuru?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Mu mone matemo o mu murundu edi a kura. Ka a fuyuka ku kwama nji ku hota wanda, unone naa mi tongwera ci shaanga Fumu Solomoni mu kutethzima kwenthzi kokuhe ka ekarire nekoveyo yoiwa eci aa matemo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ngeci Nyambi aa twethsa ku vateka kengeyo muhonyi o mu murundu o kuninga ci rero ko u di, peunthza waa kuheriwa mu dirungu ne, ene nga ka a twethsa ku mi yenga amwe? Mayuwane amwe mwanu mwa shopu thsitawo!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Karo mwa cithzekera ci ine mwa ku dya nji ci ine mwa ku nwa, mwa cishupwathzeka enu yo kengeyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Inene eyi yoihe po yodiyo a na randarandanga anu o kaye. Unone Tata wenu po o na dimuka ci yaa fotahara ku kwenu eyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Uno honi mu fote Kutumina kwenthzi, aye kenge a ku mi pa yoihe eyi enu.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rufumo ro ku wiru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Wa yapa owe o mutangaana, inene Tata wenu po i na mu nyanyukithsa yo ku mi pa Kutumina. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mu urithse eyi mu di nayo, ao madi mu a pe ahepwe. Mu cipakere epaupau yo kukana ku kurupara, rufumo ro mu wiru ro kukana kwipa, kwithsa mwithzi oyu nga thzako nji ku rwipithsa menje. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Oku ru di rufumo rwenu, no micima thzenu kodiyo thzi di.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu taterere no ku ciroithsera kukeya kwa Fumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Mu ange miya thzenu thzi tanare, karo mu muneke tumbarambara twenu no ku ciroithsera yoihe eyi ya ku mi keyera. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mu cipiture eci anu o ku taterera ñathsire wo ci a ka huke ku ka tunda ku thsidika thso wenga, ci popahe apa a ka hukera kamona ayepo ngongomona, a yokorore ku mu yanthzurwera. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Akwathsiyauthzi angamba awa a ku na wana ñathsire wo o kwa kenga ou a ku kuma. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kenge a ku honya thsikoveyo no ku wekarithsa ku tafure a ku wa ere edya. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Awo angamba kenge a kwikara no thsiyauthzi ou a ku na wa wana o kwa kenga ou a ku keya pa kaci kothsiku nji ruura.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />“Mu dimuke ci thsinda thsa nthzio nga aa dimukanga thsikati ethsi a keya mwithzi, nga tumba a thsierera mwithzi o ku tuva nthzio thzenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Namwe karo mu ciroithsere, inene ame no Mwana Munu kenge na ku keya thsikati ethsi mu na kana ku dimuka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngamba o ku rurama noyu o kukana ku rurama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Peturu wepurire ci: “Fumu, aka kathsimo ne waa ka tera atwe pohuma nji nanu amweya?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Fumu wa mu tawire ci: “Edye mupika o munu shemwa nonyanyami, oyu a ku pa ñathsire wenthzi ku endithsa nthzio thzenthzi no ku eranga aenthzenthzi apika edya ko thsikati ethsi thsi na roera? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Oyo mupika oyo kenge a kwikara no thsiyauthzi ngeci waa ku na mu wane ñathsire wenthzi o ku tendanga kengeyo, ou a ku ka huka. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci oyo mupika kenge a ku mu pa ku endithsa rufumo rwa ñathsire wenthzi roruhe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Unone honi ngeci oya ngamba waa ku ambe mu mucima wenthzi ci, ‘Ñathsire wange kure a di no ku keya,’ ayepo tateka ku dikauranga aenthzenthzi apika wakwerume nambuyama no ku dya no ku nwa no ku penda. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Ñathsire wenthzi diyuwa edi a ku kuma ko thsiundumukera o ku na kana ku dimuka, oya mupika kenge a ku na mu cinaura tupinthzipinthzi no ku mu paka mofoci nakwakukana ku tawa.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Mupika o ku dimuka eyi a shima ñathsire wenthzi ci nga na i tende, unone kadi wa ku i ciroithsera ku i tenda, kenge a ku piwa humbithso thzo ku furiwa nene. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Unone honi oyu na kana ku dimuka, ngeci ayepo tenda eyi i na roera ku piwera humbithso, kenge a ku piwa humbithso thzothzionye. Oyu na piwa yoingi ku kwenthzi ku na tatereriwa ku wanako yoingi pa ku huthsa, oyu naa piwa ekwama yoikuru kenge kwa ku fotiwa yoingi ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mukwa ku tepa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Kuma na ni keyera ku na fakara mudiro mu kaye, naa cikumbwethza ci nga u na yuuma kare. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ni di no korovethzo ethzi ni na roera ku korovethziwa, naa thzi cithzekera shime ou thza ku pwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ene mwa anekera ci naa keyera ku reta thsiyaro pano pa kaye? Dyombo, naa keya ku na tepa anu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ku tunda pano mikuta thzothzingi kenge thza ku citepa, akwa mutanu mu dira dyo kenge a ku citepa, ahatu a ku thzimbe aidi, nawo aidi a ku thzimbe waya ahatu.<verse eid="LUK 12:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />“Mushemi o mukwerume a ku thzimbe mwanenthzi o mukwerumeana, naye mukwerumeana a ku thzimbe tata wenthzi, mushemi o mbuyama a cithzimbe na mwanenthzi o mbuyamaana, naye mbuyamaana a thzimbe mama wenthzi, ngumwenya munu a cithzimbe na munu wa mwanenthzi, naye munu wa mwanenthzi a thzimbe mama wa munuwenthzi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kudimukera ekati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu wa thsiurukerire ku mbunga no ku amba ci: “Kamona mu mona mavui o kwa tunderera mu mutoko, mwaa ninga ci mvura pepi a di no ku roka, karo yaa dikara kengeyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Yoihe mu yuva mupepo o ku u pepa ku tunderera mu mboera mwaa amba ci: ‘Kenge ku pya’, karo yoshemwa dyo ikara. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Mwaa kenga pashi no ku wiru no ku dimuka thsikati thso mwaka, mwaa kwanga ngepi ku dimuka yo thsino thsikati edi ya kwikara?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi mu na roera ku tenda o ku mu na cipithsera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Ngepi dyo ku kwanga ku hangura eyi i na roera? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />O ku thza na mukwathsithzimbo thsoe ku kuta, o ereke nene ku ciyuva nenthzi mu dikuñwa. Inene kamona ayepo ka ku kumithsa kwa mukwakuratura, mukwakuratura aye kenge a ka kwithsera tupathso otu tu ka ku twara mu kamenga. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Naa ku tongwera ko wa ku tundamo shime ou wa ku manenena ku kura murandu ouhe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ambera anu ci a cere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Kwa di awa ekarirepo kethsiya thsikati, awa a tongwerire Yesu yo Magalilea awa epaire Pilatu o kwa tumekera eyambero mu Tembere. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ene mwaa anekera ci awo Magalilea po anu wevi nene kupita Magalilea amweya ngethsi a fererire kengeyo nji? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Dyombo! Unone namwe ngeci ka mwa ku cera ekwama yenu yoimango kenge mwa ku fa kengeyo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Awaya ne, waya o dikumi na mutanu nahatu awaya wa wererire otara wa Siloami, ene mwaa anekera ci epithsire nene kupita amweya awa ekarire mu Yerusalema nji? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Dyombo! Naa mi ambera karo ci ngeci ka mwa ku cera, namwe mwahe kenge mwa ku fa eci awo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kokuyu o kukana kwima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yesu wa wa tongwerire aka kathsimo ci: “Munu yumweya wa kunine okuyu mu dikanda dyenthzi. Wa thzire ku ka fotako ñuyu, unone ka a ka thzi wanineko. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Wa amberire mukwakunyunga dikanda ci: ‘Ni na kwanithsa myaka thzihatu honi o ku na ni fotangako ñuyu oku kukuyu, unone kwithsa ku thzi wanako. O u hendure kwithsa eyi nga wipithsera muve.’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />“Unone mukwakunyunga dikanda wa ambire ci: ‘Ñathsire wange, o u thsie uno mwaka pohuma, kenge na ku thsima ku thzingurukithsa dithsina dyao na ku pakeko wiro. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ngeci o wa kwime ku makomwa i na roo. Unone ngeci ka wa kwima mbeci wa ku u hendure.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mbuyama dyo Savata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Diyuwa dimweya dyo Savata, Yesu o ku rongithsa mu sinagoge, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />kwekarire mbuyama oyu wa korire myaka thzo dikumi na mutanu na thzihatu. Wekarire no mupepo oumango ou wa mu kundumanithsire muongo karo kadi wa ku twethsa ku oroka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu ou a mu monine wa mwithsire no ku mu ambera ci: “Mama! O na rukururiwa kwikora yoe.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Wa mu kambekire moko, popo wa orokire ayepo shangara Nyambi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Unone muendithsi o sinagoge wa anthzipire pa ku mu porithsa Yesu dyo Savata. Wa amberire mbunga ci: “Ko a di mayuwa o mutanu na dyofoci o ku kwama, mu keyange mwao mayuwa ku na mi porithsa, kadi dyo Savata.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Fumu wa mu tawire ci: “Amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Munu no munu ku kwenu aa kwamanga dyo Savata! Ene ka mu puturangire mapuru enu nji endongi yenu pa fungo no ku i twara ku ka nwa meyu dyo Savata nji? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Uno honi oyu mbuyama mwana Aburahama, oyu na angiwa kwa Satana myaka thzo dikumi na mutanu na thzihatu ne kadi iwa ku mu putura mu diyuwa dyo Savata nji?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Eyi a tawire Yesu ya enithsire akwethzimbo yenthzi. Unone mbunga thzothzihe thza roerire yoihe eyi a kwamine.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dinanda dyotata no mamene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Kutumina kwa Nyambi ne kwaa cipitura eci thsine? No thsine nga ni ku piturithsa? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Kwaa cipitura eci dinanda dyotata edi a kunine munu mu dikanda dyenthzi. Dya menine no ku piruka thsitondo nenyunyi ya umberireko mataratara ku mite thzathso.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mamene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Karo wa ambire ci: “No thsine nga ni ku piturithsa Kutumina kwa Nyambi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Kwaa cipitura eci mamene aa a na pakerera mbuyama noshunga ku ruva ci dikende di tunduruke.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsero thzo kuciomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu ou a thzire ku Yerusalema wa pitire mu mambongi no mu maumbo o ku thza o rongithsa. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Munu yumweya wa mwipurire ci: “Fumu! Ene anu owapu awa a ku yoyithsiwa nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Wa wa amberire ci: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mu citanarithse ci mwingene mu thsero thzo ku ciomba, inene owangi kenge a ku ereka kwingenamo, unone ka ku twethsa kwingenamo. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Thsinda thsa nthzio ou a ku pata ku thsero, kenge mwa kwimana pora ku ngongomona no ku adikanena ci: ‘Ñathsire wetu, o tu yanthzurwere.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">“Unone kenge a ku mi tawa ci: ‘Ka ni mi dimuka nji ku dimuka oku mu na tundu.’<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />“Unone kenge mwa ku mu huthsa ci: ‘Twa dire no ku nwa noe karo shime waa rongithsa mu makuñwa etu.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />“Aye kenge a ku mi tawa ci: ‘Ka ni mi dimuka nji ku dimuka oku mu na tundu. Mu tunde ku kwange mwahe amwe mwanu owamango.’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />“Omo kenge kwa kwikara ku dira no ku cihuma nwaeo, inene kenge mwa ku mona Aburahama, Isaka, Jakovo nakwakukethza wahe mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi, unone amwe kenge mwa ku konthzeriwa pora. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Anu kenge a ku tunda ku muvo no ku mutoko, ku wiko no ku mboera ku nekara ku tafure ku thsidika mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Yoshemwa kwa di awa a di ku manyima awa a kwikara ku rupara, karo awa a di ku rupara kenge a kwikara ku manyima.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa direrera Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Kethsiya thsikati Afarithsi amweya a keyire kwa Yesu no ku amba ci: “O tunde muno mu ndau o thze kwako. Heroda aa fota ku kwipaa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Mu thze mu ka tongwere oyo mbwawa ci: ‘Kenge ni twara ku rupara ku cithza mathzimu no ku porithsa anu rero no peunthza, mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu o ku ni na mana ekwama yange.’<verse eid="LUK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />“Shaanga kengeyo naa roera ku katuka rero, peunthza no pandere o ku ni enda, inene ka ku roerire ci mukwakukethza a ku paiwere kwako shime mu Yerusalema!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Mayuwane Yerusalema, mayuwane Yerusalema, owe o nepaanga akwakukethza no ku povaura no mawe tunganda twa Nyambi. Kadi edi ni na foto ku paka pofoci anoe eci ñathzishushwa edi a na pakanga tuciyociyo twenthzi mu mando enthzi, unone ka mu fotire! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />O na mono honi, diumbo dyoe kenge dya kwikara diundu. Ka mwa ku ni mona shime apa mwa ku amba ci: ‘Wa thsiyauthzi oyu keya mu dithzina dya Fumu.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Mem 118.26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu mu diyuwa dyo Savata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Diyuwa dimweya dyo Savata, Yesu wa thzire ku ka dya mu nthzio thza muendithsi wAfarithsi, anu awa ekariremo wahe a mu kengererire. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ku rupara rwenthzi kwekarire mukwerume o ku tuumana mauru no moko. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu wepurire Afarithsi nakwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda ci: “Ene murao ne waa tawethza ku porithsa munu mu diyuwa dyo Savata nji dyombo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Unone ka mu tawire thsimweya. Aye wa kwatire mukwakukora no ku mu porithsa no ku mu ambera ci a thze ku diumbo dyenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Wa wepurire karo ci: “Ngeci yumweya ku kwenu o di no mwanenthzi nji puru ayepo wera mu dithsima dyodithzungi mu diyuwa dyo Savata, ene tumba nga a mu tundithsamo wangu nji?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Unone napo karo ka twethsire ku mu tawa thsimweya.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rongithsa keyi yo kucihuthsa kushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu ou a monine enda amweya edi a cihangwerire epura yo direma ku tafure, wa wa terire aka kathsimo ci: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“O ku na raiwa ku thsidika thso wenga, wa thzererera ku kekara mu thsipura thso direma. Ngeci owepo tenda kengeyo kuinashimi munu yumweya o ku remekiwa kupita owe naye na raiwa oko ku thsidika. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Oyu na ku raa kenge a keya ku na ku ambera ci: ‘O pe oyu ekare omo o nekara.’ Uno honi kenge o katuka ko honyi no ku kekara mu thsipura thso kupira direma ku manyima.<verse eid="LUK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />“Unone o ku na raiwa ku thsidika o wikare mu thsipura thso kupira direma ci oyu na ku raa ku thsidika ou a keya naa ku ambere ci: ‘Shadi, o katuke o kekare mu thsipura thso direma!’ Mweyo, kenge o remekiwa mu kaci kowa na raiwa wahe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Inene munu yomuhe o ku cithzineka kenge a ku huthsiwa kushi, unone o ku cihuthsa kushi kenge a ku thzinekiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Karo Yesu wa amberire oyu wa mu raire ci: “O ku na raa anu ku mucithsuko nji murarero wethsako ambushoe, aminoe, akuruoe, apoe, nji andamboe wafumanyi. Ngeci owepo o tenda kengeyo, nawo kenge a ku ku raa nowe ci a ka ku huthsere eyi no wa pa. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Unone o ku na kwama dishambirera o withseko ahepwe, ekunga, erema no tupuputwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Ngeci owepo o tenda kengeyo, kenge wa kwikara no thsiyauthzi. Shaanga ci ka ku twethsa ku ku huthsera thsimweya, Nyambi yodiyo wa ku ku huthsera mu diyuwa dyo kupinduka kwafu kowa owawawa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko thsidika thsoshokuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Yumweya kowa dire na Yesu ou a yuvire eyo, wa amberire Yesu ci: “Wa thsiyauthzi munu oyu wa kwikara ku tafure, ku thsidika mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu wa mu tawire ko kathsimo ci: “Kwekarire mukwerume oyu wa kwamine thsidika thsoshokuru oku a raerire anu owangi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Thsidika o ku thsi di po pepi no ku tendahara, wa tumine mupikenthzi ku ka tongwera anu awa a raire ci a keye, inene enu yoihe i na kwana.<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />“Unone wahe a ka tatekire ku amburura. O kutanga wa ambire ci: ‘Na ni uru dikanda naa fota ci ni ka di mone, o ni kwatereko.’<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />“Yumweya wa ambire ci: ‘Na ni uru mapuru epani yo mutanu naa fota ku ka a ereka. O adikane o ni kwatereko.’<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />“Yumweya karo wa ambire ci: ‘Mu wenga ni di, tumba i tawa ci ni keye.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Oya mupika wa hukire no ku ka tongwera ñathsire wenthzi yoihe. Thsinda thsa thsidika wa anthzipire no ku ambera mupikenthzi ci: ‘O thze mu makuñwa no mu mambanthza o mu maumbo, o rete ahepwe, erema, tupuputwa nekunga.’<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />“Oya mupika ou a ka hukire wa amberire ñathsire wenthzi ci: ‘Ni na tende ethsi o na ni raerera, unone nthzio ka thzi yarire.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />“Ñathsire wenthzi wa mu amberire ci: ‘O thze mu mikwakwa no mu makuñwa oahe, o ka konge anu wahe awo wana a keye ci nthzio thzange thzi yare. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Naa ku ambera yoshemwa ci kwithsa shaanga yofoci kowa na ni tanga ku raa oyu dya ku dishambirera dyange.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi i na fotahara ci o wikare thsirongwa thsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Mbunga thzothzikuru thza shupwerire Yesu, wa cithsetukire no ku wa ambera ci: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Yomuhe o ku fota ku keya ku kwange ci ekare thsirongwa thsange, shime a tange tango ku thzimba tata wenthzi, mama wenthzi, munuwenthzi, anenthzi, apenthzi, aminenthzi, akurwenthzi no mwoyo wenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Munu o kukana ku shimba mbinda thzenthzi no ku ni shupwera, tumba a twethsa kwikara thsirongwa thsange.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Mu anekere ci yumweya ku kwenu nga aa fota ku umba otara, shime a tange tango kwikara pashi no ku tara ecikwathsithsa eyi nga i twethsa ku manenena ekwama ci a dimuke ci vungashi nga i uriwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ngeci ayepo tateka ku shisha mushisho no ku kwanga ku u mana, wahe awa a ku u mona kenge a ku mu teurura. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Kenge a ku amba ci: ‘Oyu munu ne, na a tateka nawa ku umba, unone naa kwanga ku manenena ekwama yenthzi.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Nji nga fumu yumweya ayepo fota ku ka rwithsa fumu yumweya. Ene nga ka a tanga tango kwikara pashi ku anekera ci mashwarare enthzi o 10,000 ne kenge nga a twethsa ku ka rwithsa oya keya no mashwarare o 20,000? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ngeci ayepo mona ci tumba a mu twethsa ku mu rwithsa, kenge a tumako anu o ku di ko kure ku ka ambaura noya keya ci kwikare thsiyaro. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Mofoci nenu, o kukana ku shuva eyi a di nayo yoihe tumba a twethsa kwikara thsirongwa thsange.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungwa o ku tutukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mungwa po uwa, unone ngeci u na tutukwa ne ngepi nga u kwamiwa karo ci u toware. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ka u roerire shaanga ku muve nji kwikara wiro. Waa roera pohuma ku u mwaera pora. Oyu di no matwi o ku yuvithsa a yuve.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dingu dyokuyonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Diyuwa dimweya, aterithsi nanu wevi a henyenine wahe kwa Yesu ku na mu teerera. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Afarithsi narongithsi o murao a tatekire ku shonaura ci: “Oyu munu aa tamburanga anu wevi no ku dyano.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Unone Yesu wa wa terire kathsimo ci: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ngeci ku kwenu kwaa di oyu di no mangu o makumi dikumi, apopo pa yonga dyofoci, ene nga ka a thsii ao o 99 mu murundu no ku ka fota edyo di na yongopo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />O ku na ka di wana, kenge a di cikambeka pa mapee enthzi, ko thsinyanyu, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />no ku thza ku diumbo. Yoihe a ka kuma, aethsa ambushenthzi nowa a na cihatano, no ku amba ci: ‘Mu ni nyanyukithseko, inene ni na wana diya dingu dyange na di yongo.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Naa mi tongwera ci kenge kwa kwikara thsinyanyu mu wiru pa munu o thsivi yofoci o ku cera, kupita anu o 99 owawawa, awa a na kana ku roera ku cera.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko muwayawaya o kuyonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Nji mbuyama o ku di no madi o dikumi o muwayawaya o silivera ci pa yonge muwayawaya ofoci ne, ene nga ka a muneka kambarambara no ku komba mu nthzio ku di fotafota shime ku di wana? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Yoihe a di wana aethsa ambushenthzi nowa a na cihatano, no ku amba ci: ‘Mu ni nyanyukithseko, inene aya madi ange naa ni yongo ni na a wana.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mweyo, naa mi tongwera ci Nyambi no tungeru twenthzi aa nyanyuka munu o thsivi o ku na cera.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mwana o kuyonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu wa shumunine ko ku wa tera kathsimo ci: “Kwekarire munu yumweya oyu wekarire nana aidi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Minamunu wa amberire tata wenthzi ci: ‘Tata, o ni ere ku rufumo rwoe oru nga mba ni erako ku rupara.’ Tata wenthzi wa tawire no ku wa era etere momu widi wo.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />“Munyima thzo mayuwa oapu, mwanenthzi shoonye wa urithsire oro rufumo a mu pire no ku shimba madi ku thza ku ditunga dyo kure, oku a ka pethsapethserire madi enthzi ko kayoyero kokamango. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Madi enthzi ou a pwire, kwekarire ndombo muya mu ditunga a thzire, wa tatekire ku nyanda. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Wa thzire kwa munu yumweya omo mu ditunga ci a ka fote ko ekwama, aye wa mu twarire ku makanda ci a ka mu futithserange nguru thzenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Wa cikumbwethzire ku dya namurungu oyu a pangire nguru, unone kwithsa o ku u mu pa.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />“Ku hura wa cikupurire ci: ‘Ku diumbo apika tata wahe aa dya yoihe eyi a na foto shime ku i thsiangapo, uno honi ame kuno naa fa ku nthzara. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Kenge na ku huka kwa tata, wangu na ku ka mu ambere ci: “Tata, na ni pithsera Nyambi no kwipithsera owe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ka ni roerire kwithsiwa ci no mwanoe, o ni pirure pohuma mupikoe.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Popo wa katukire no ku huka kwa tata wenthzi.<figure style="fig" alt="Father greets his lost son 20" file="dn00485b.tif" size="col" loc="Luk 15:17-24" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="15.17-24">Mwana oyu wa yongire</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“O ku endera kokure kamanana no diumbo, tata wenthzi wa mu monine no ku mu yuvera ñekeñeke, wa mu cirerire no ku ka mu wera mu thsimbando no ku mu yamwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwane wa mu amberire ci: ‘Tata, na ni pithsera Nyambi no kwipithsera owe. Ka ni roerire kwithsiwa ci mwanoe.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />“Unone tata wenthzi wa amberire apikenthzi ci: ‘Mu yokorore! Mu rete evata yoiwa nene mu mu vateke. Mu mu shupeke kanthzea ku munwe no ku mu vateka mashangu kwidyato. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mu rete pohoana o mununu mu mu kañare tu tende dishambirera. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Inene oyu mwanange shime aa fa, unone honi aa yoya. Shime aa yonga, unone honi na waniwa.’ Popo dishambirera dya tatekire.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Kethsiya thsikati mwanenthzi shokuru o ku ka di ku dikanda. Ou a ka hukire o ku kokera ku diumbo, wa yuvire anu o kwemba no ku shika maoma, o kwa kina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Wepurire yumweya kwapika ci: ‘Ine eyi i tendahara kuno?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Aye wa mu tawire ci: ‘Minoe na ka huka, tata woe o na mwipaera pohoana o mununu, inene mwanenthzi na ka mu hukera no kafunda ko mwoyo.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Mukurwamunu wa anthzipire nene, wa kanine no ku henyena oku dya tendaharerire dishambirera. Tata wenthzi wa punenineko ku ka mu hengawethza ci a thze ku dishambirera. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Unone aye wa amberire tata wenthzi ci: ‘O na mono! Na ni ku kwamena myaka thzothzingi eci mupika, karo ka na kana ku yuvera thsiraerera thsoe. Unone ame wa diyerire o ni pa shaanga kamembeana ci ni cishambirere nambushange. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Rero pano oyu mwanoe na a ka pethsapethsa rufumo rwoe mu ruthziho, uno a na ka huka o na mu paera pohoana o mununu.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />“Tata wenthzi wa mu tawire ci: ‘Mwanange, owepo noe ni nekaranga myaka thzothzihe, yoihe eyi ni di nayo po yoe nowe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Twaa roera ku tenda dishambirera no ku nyanyuka, inene minoe shime aa fa, unone mu yumi. Karo shime aa yonga, unone na waniwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko muendithsi o rufumo o mumango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu wa terire kathsimo erongwa yenthzi ci: “Kwekarire fumanyi oyu wekarire no muendithsi o rufumo rwenthzi. Diyuwa dimweya wa yuvire ci oyu muendithsi o rufumo rwenthzi po aa rwipithsa. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ñathsire oya munu wa mwithsire ci engene no ku mwipura ci: ‘Ine eyi ni yuva keyi yo muendithsero woe? Ni monithse enu yoihe, inene ko wa kwikara karo muendithsi o rufumo rwange.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />“Oyu muendithsi o rufumo wa cipurire ci: ‘Ngepi ni tenda? Ñathsire wange aa ni tundithsa pekwama. Ka ni di nokoro o ku dima dikanda, karo ku kumbera kenge ya ku ni fithsa honyi. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ni na dimuka ethsi na ku tenda ci anu a ku ni tambure mu myanda thzo ou na ku tundithsiwa pekwama.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Wethsire munu no munu oyu wa shimbire makongo kwa ñathsire wenthzi. Wepurire o kutanga ci: ‘Vungashi no korotera ñathsire wange?’<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />“Wa mu tawire ci: ‘Makumi o dikumi o tuhupa to maathzi.’ Muendithsi o rufumo wa mu amberire ci: ‘O shimbe diñoro dyoe dyo makongo, ko wanguwangu o ñorepo makumi mutanu pohuma.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />“Wepurire o muthsidi ci: ‘Owe ne vungashi no korotera ñathsire wange?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Wa tawire ci: ‘Mathsaka o makumi o dikumi o vuroto.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">“Wa mu amberire ci: ‘O shimbe diñoro dyo makongo, o ñorepo makumi mutanu na ahatu pohuma.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Ñathsire oya muendithsi o kukana ku rurama wa mu shangarire nene, pakuninga ci shime a kwamine konyanyami. Anu o muno mu kaye a di nonyanyami kupita anu o mu mwethzi komu a tendera enu mu kaciko.” <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Mu cifotere ambusha ko rufumo ro kaye ci shaanga apa mbo ru pwa mba mi tambure mu maumbo o diyere.”<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />“Munu yomuhe o ku rurama keyi yoipu, kenge a ku rurama shaanga keyi yoingi, o kukana ku rurama keyi yoionye tumba a rurama shaanga keyi yoikuru. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ngeci ka mu ruramine ko rufumo ro kaye ne, ngepi mwa ku rurama ko rufumo roshemwa ro ku wiru? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ngeci ka na mu rurama keyi yanu amweya, oyu wa ku mi pa yo ku mi thsa ci yenu ne edye?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Kwithsa ngamba o ku kwamena añathsire aidi. Inene kenge a thzimbapo yofoci no ku shima yumweya, nji ku remekapo yumweya no ku shwahura yumweya. Tumba mu twethsa ku kwamena Nyambi no ku kwamena madi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa imweya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Afarithsi awa shimine nene madi ou a yuvire eyo, a mu teururire. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Yamwe mu na cimonithsanga pa meho anu ci mwawawa, unone Nyambi po na dimuka micima thzenu. Ethsi a na remeka anu, pa meho a Nyambi po aa thsi mona ci omango o kupiterera.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Murao wa Mushe neyi a ambire akwakukethza na i kwama, shime ku na kuma mu thsikati thsa Johani Mukwakukorovethza. Ku tunda apo, Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi waa hongiwa, anu wahe aa ootera ci engene mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Kenge nga iotopa ci diwiru no kaye i pwe kupita ku tundithsa ku murao wa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Mukwerume yomuhe o ku rukurura munuwenthzi no ku yeka wao na rembeka, o ku yeka mbuyama oyu naa rukururiwa na rembeka.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fumanyi na Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Yesu wa ambire ci, kwekarire mukwerume o fumanyi oyu naa vatanga evata yo muvara o muhombohombo yo ku tura nene, wa yoyire nawa mayuwa oahe. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Pa thsero thzenthzi na retangapo hepwe o dithzina dyo Lazaro oyu wa korire eronda. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Wa kuruperangire ci kenge na a dya kumwamwauthzi ou u wa ku tafure thza fumanyi. No mbwa thza keyangire ku na mu rathsa peronda yenthzi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Oya hepwe ou a fire, tungeru twa keyire ku na mu shimba, ku kekara ku nyonga thza Aburahama. Oya fumanyi naye wa fire, ayepo vumbekiwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Oya fumanyi o ku di mu ndau thzafu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dihere. Hadesi mu Thsigerike.</char></note> kengeyo, wa nyandire nene. Wa monine Lazaro o ku di ku nyonga thza Aburahama o kwa di kokure. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Fumanyi wa ambire ko ku kumba ci: ‘Tata Aburahama, o ni fere ñeke, o tume Lazaro ci a cimbeke munwe wenthzi mu meyu, naa ni hoyithsere pa rudimi, inene naa yuva nene kukora muno mu mirengi!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Unone Aburahama wa mutawire ci: ‘Mwanange, o anekere thsiya thsikati o ku yoya nawa, shime waa piwa yoingi yoiwa, unone Lazaro aye po wekarire mu dikando. Thsino po thsikati thsenthzi naye thso ku yoya nawa kuno, uno honi nowe waa nyanda. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ku tundapo ko u di mutapo oukuru outhzungi mu kaci ketu namwe, ci awa fota ku keya mu thsambwedyo a pire ko ku pitera, nowa a fota ku keya mu thsambwadino nawo a pire ko ku pitera.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />“Fumanyi wa tawire ci: ‘Mbecipo dyo i di kengeyo, naa ku adikanena tata, o tume Lazaro ku nthzio thza tata, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />inene kwa di aminange nakurwange o mutanu wakwerume, a ka wa nomenithse ci katere a ku keye muno mu ndau thzo makando ni di.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Aburahama wa tawire ci: ‘Mushe nakwakukethza na nomenithsa awo aminoe nakurwoe, a wa teerere.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Fumanyi wa tawire ci: ‘Dyombo, tata Aburahama! Tumba i cishoko no mufu o ku na pinduka ku ka wa tongwera. Kenge a ka mu yuva no ku cera ekwama yo yoimango no ku thsiurukera kwa Nyambi.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Unone Aburahama wa mu amberire ci: ‘Ngeci po kadi akwa ku yuva ya Mushe nakwakukethza, shaanga mufu nga pinduka tumba nga ka rakwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Thsivi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Enu eyi ya ku huwa anu no ku wa retera ci a tende thsivi i na roera ku keya. Uno honi o di nothsimo munu oyu wa ku i reta. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ku di nawa ci nga a angereriwa diwe dyodiremu mu thsingo no ku konthzeriwa mu diwate, kupita ci a withse awo owaonye. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Mweyo mu cinyunge!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Ngeci muenthzoe ayepo kwipithsera, o mu kuturure, ngeci ayepo cera, o mu kwatere. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Shaanga ci aa kwipithsera miendo thzo mutanu na thzidi mu diyuwa, o ku keyanga ku na amba ci: ‘Ni na cera,’ o mu kwatere.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Tunganda twa amberire Fumu ci: “O tu vungithsere ku thsitawo thsetu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Fumu wa tawire ci: “Nga mu di no thsitawo shaanga thso ku kuma pa dinanda dyotata kenge nga mu twethsa ku ambera ethsi thsitondo thsokuyu ci: ‘O thzuruke o ka cishishe mu diwate!’ Kenge nga thsi mi yuvera.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Tu fekithse kenge ci ku kwenu kwaa di oyu di no ngamba o ku mu dimena dikanda dyenthzi nji ku ka mu futithsera mangu. Yoihe a ka huka ku dikanda, ene kenge nga a mu ambera ci: ‘O keye no dye’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Dyombo, kenge a mu ambera ci: ‘O ni kwamene murarero karo o ciroithse no ni pe edya ni dye no ku nwa. Ou ni mana ku dya nowe mbeci honi o dye no ku nwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ene oya ñathsire oya ngamba ne kenge a kanderera koya ngamba pakuninga ci o na kwama yoihe eyi a na mu tumina nji? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Namwe dyo mu di kengeyo, o ku mu na kwama enu yoihe eyi mu na tongweriwa ku kwama mwaa roera ku amba ci: ‘Atwe po twangamba pohuma, twaa kwama eyi tu na roera ku kwama.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa akwengondwe o dikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu o ku thza ku Yerusalema wa pitire mu kaci ka Samaria na Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />O ku wingena mu diumbo akwerume o dikumi wengondwe a mu hanganine. Emanine kokure nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />A kuererire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Yesu, Ñathsire wetu! O tu fere ñeke.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ou a wa monine wa wa amberire ci: “Mu thze ku mapurisita a ka mi mone.” O kwa ka thza kengeyo, wahe a porire.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumweya kukwo ou a monine ci na poro, wa hukire kwa Yesu o ku shangara Nyambi ko diywi dyodikuru. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Wa na wererire ku mauru a Yesu no ku kanderera ku kwenthzi, karo oyu mukwerume po Musamaria.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Ene kadi akwa dikumi waya a na porithsiwa? Awaya amweya o mutanu nane ne kupi a di? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ene kwithsa shaanga yofoci kukwo oyu na ka huka ku na shangara Nyambi shime oyu mutundakure?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Wa mu amberire ci: “O katuke o thze, thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku porithsa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo kukeya ko Kutumina kwa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Diyuwa dimweya, Afarithsi epurire Yesu ci: Diyuwa dipi kwa ku keya Kutumina kwa Nyambi? Aye wa wa tawire ci: “Kutumina kwa Nyambi po ka kwa ku keya ko thsimonithso thso ku twethsa ku moniwa ko meho, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />nji anu ku amba ci: ‘Kuno ku di kuno’ nji ‘kuya ku di kuya,’ Inene Kutumina kwa Nyambi po mu kaci kenu ku di.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Thsikati thsaa keya ethsi mwa ku fota ku mona Mwana Munu mu diyuwa edi a ku ka huka, unone ka mwa ku di mona.” <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Anu kenge a ku mi tongwera ci: “Mwana Munu oya di kuya, nji ci ono di kuno! Unone mwa ku thzako nji ku wa shupwera. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Eci kwethsa ko mvura edi ku nethsanga ku wiru ku tunda ku hura thzimweya ku thza ku hura thzimweya, dyo kwa kwikara no mu diyuwa edi a ku keya Mwana Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Unone Mwana Munu aa roera ku nyandithsiwa tango no ku kaniwa kwanu o rerodino.”<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Dyodi yekarire mu thsikati thsa Nuwe dyo ya kwikara no mu thsikati thsa Mwana Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Anu shime aa dya, aa nwa, ku yeka no ku yekithsiwa shime ku na kuma mu diyuwa edi engenine Nuwe mu areka. Dimina dyodikuru dya paire anu wahe.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />“Dyo yekarire no mu thsikati thsa Lota, anu shime aa dya, aa nwa, aa ura no ku urithsa, karo shime aa kuna no ku umba, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />shime ku na kuma mathsikuthsiku o diyuwa edi a tundire Lota mu Sodoma, kwa rokire mudiro no sulufura ku wiru no ku na wa thzirithsa wahe.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Dyo ya kwikara no mu diyuwa edi a ku hokoriwa Mwana Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mwedyo diyuwa munu oyu di pa thsituwa thso nthzio ka a roerire ku shiruka ci a ka shimbe etere mu nthzio thzenthzi. Noyu ka di ku dikanda ka a roerire ku ka huka ku diumbo. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mu vuruke eyi ya tendaharire kwa munu wa Lota! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Munu yomuhe o ku shima nene mwoyo wenthzi kenge a ku u yawa. Unone o ku shuva mwoyo wenthzi kenge a ku u yoyithsa. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Naa mi tongwera, mo uya othsiku kwanu aidi awa a na rara podidi ofoci, yumweya kenge a ku shimbiwa yumweya kenge a ku thsiiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Ambuyama aidi awa a twa mu kakunthzu kofoci, yumweya kenge a ku shimbiwa yumweya a ku thsiiwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Anu aidi awa di ku dikanda yumweya kenge a ku shimbiwa yumweya a ku thsiiwe.]”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Erongwa yenthzi ya mwipurire ci: “Fumu, ene kupi ya ku tendaharera eyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Oku ku di thsinu thso kufa kodiyo a ciwanawanena makwi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mukwakuratura no difakathzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu wa terire erongwa yenthzi kathsimo ku wa rongithsa ci aa roera ku romberanga thsikati thsothsihe ko kukana ku huka munyima. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Wa ambire ci: “Mu mbongi thzimweya kwekarire mukwakuratura oyu wa kanine ku yapa Nyambi nji ku remeka anu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Omo mu mbongi karo kwekarire mbuyama o difakathzi oyu wa keyangire ku kwenthzi ku na rombanga ci: ‘O ni tende nawa, o ni kengere thsiamba thsange noyu na ni thzekithsa.’<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Wa shimbire thsikati thsothsire kadi wa ku tenda kengeyo, unone wa anekerire ci: ‘Ka ni yapire Nyambi nji ku remeka anu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />uno honi pakuninga ci oyu difakathzi aa ni shupa, kenge na ku mu tenda nawa ci katere a ni tenderange muyoyo!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Unone Fumu wa ambire ci: “Mu na yuvu eyi a na amba oyu mukwakuratura omumango? <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ene Nyambi ne nga ka a tende nawa anuenthzi awa naa hangura awa a direrera ku kwenthzi mutenya nothsiku nji? Ene kenge a ku katapa ku wa kwathsa nji? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Naa mi tongwera, kenge a ku yokorora ku wa tenda nawa. Unone ou a ku keya Mwana Munu ne kenge a ku na wana thsitawo mu kaye nji?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko Mufarithsi no muterithsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu wa terire aka kathsimo anu amweya awa a cishimbire ci awawa no ku shwahura amweya: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Akwerume aidi a thzire ku Tembere ku ka rombera, yumweya nedi Mufarithsi yumweya nedi Muterithsi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mufarithsi wemanine no ku ciromberera ci: ‘Nyambi, naa kanderera ku koe ci ame ka ni cishokire nanu amweya akwamakupakupa, wamango, nakwamirembe nji eci oyu Muterithsi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Naa cikanganga no nthzara miendo thzidi mu sunda, naa panga thsimweya thso mudikumi kweyi ni na wananga yoihe.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Unone muterithsi aye wemanine kokure wa yapire shaanga ku kengerera ku wiru, wa cipamarire pa mbando no ku amba ci: ‘Nyambi, o ni yuvere ñeke ame no munu o thsivi.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />“Naa mi ambera ci oyu munu wa hukire ku diumbo o ku di o muwawa pa meho a Nyambi kupita oya o kutanga. Yoshemwa munu o ku cithzineka kenge a ku huthsiwa kushi, o ku cihuthsa kushi kenge a ku thzinekiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a fiyawera twanuke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Anu a retire karo tumbu kwa Yesu ci na a tu kambeke moko. Erongwa ou ya i monine ya wa kutururire. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Unone Yesu wa wethserire ku kwenthzi no ku amba ci: “Mu thsie twanuke tu keye ku kwange, mwa tu kanithsa, inene Kutumina kwa Nyambi po kwanu o kwikara eci awo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci munu yomuhe oyu wa ku kana ku tambura Kutumina kwa Nyambi eci kanuke ka a ku kengenamo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukwerume o fumanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Nduna yumweya wa mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi o muwa, ine ni na roera ku kwama ci ni wane mwoyo o diyere?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ine eyi o nithsera o muwa? Kwithsa o muwa shaanga yofoci shime Nyambi yofoci. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />O na dimuka eraerera yo kuninga ci: ‘Kadi o mukwa ku rembeka, kadi o mukwa kwipaa, kadi o mukwa kwithza, wa pa ombangi o kwithsa, o remeke tata woe no mama woe.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Diya 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Mura 5.16-20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Wa tawire ci: “Thzothzihe ethzo na thzi hengeka ku tundera ku wanuke wange.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu ou a yuvire eyi wa mu amberire ci: “Ku na thsiara thsinu thsofoci ethsi o na roera ku kwama. O urithse rufumo rwoe roruhe ao madi wangu o a pe ahepwe. Wangu wa kwikare no rufumo mu wiru, ku tunda apo o ni shupwere.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Oya fumanyi ou a i yuvire eyi, wa cinyengire nene pakuninga ci shime a fumine nene. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu ou a monine ci shime a cinyengire nene wa ambire ci: “Kukaru nene ci fumanyi engene mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Kenge nga iotopa ci kamere engene mu dithziho dyo thsonga kupita ci fumanyi engene mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Awa a yuvire eyi epurire ci: “Edye ne honi mbo yoyithsiwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Yo kukana ku tawa kwanu kwa Nyambi po yaa tawa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “O mone atwe tu na thsii yetu yoihe no ku ku shupwera.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci munu yomuhe o ku thsia diumbo dyenthzi, nji munuwenthzi, nji apenthzi, nji ashemienthzi, nji anenthzi mukaci ko Kutumina kwa Nyambi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />kenge a ku tambura yoingi mo uno mwoyo no mwoyo o diyere mu kaye aka ka keya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba karo yo kufa kwenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu wa shimbire erongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi no ku thza nayo ko kumengi no ku i ambera ci: “Mu teerere, twaa thza honi ku Yerusalema oku ya ku ka tendaharera yoihe eyi a ñorire akwakukethza keyi ya Mwana Munu. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kenge a ku ka piwa mu moko anukenge, awa a ku ka mu teurura, ku mu tuka no ku mu thsipera mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Kenge a ku ka mu mwashura no ku mwipaa, unone kenge a ku pinduka mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Tunganda ka twa yuvithsithsire eyi yaa ambiwire, inene ya horekiwire kukwo. Ka twa dimukire eyi a ambire Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa kapuputwa mu Jeriko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu ou a kokerire ku Jeriko, ku mbadi thzo dikuñwa kwekarire munu o kapuputwa oyu wa kumberangire anu. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ou a yuvire anu owangi o kwa pita, wepurire ethsi thsa tendaharire. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />A mu tongwerire ci: “Yesu wa Nazareta oyu pita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Wa kumbire ci: “Yesu, Mwana Davida o ni yuvere ñeke.”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Awa a tangerire ku rupara a mu kutururire no ku mu ambera ci a tutware, unone aye wa kuererire nene kupita pa kutanga ci: “Mwana Davida, o ni yuvere ñeke.”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu wemanine no ku tumina ci a u mu retere. Ou a henyenine po pepi, Yesu wa mwipurire ci: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Waa fota ci ni ku kwamene ine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Wa tawire ci: “Fumu, naa fota ku mona karo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O mone karo, thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku porithsa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Popo mwene wa monine, wa mu shupwerire no ku shangara Nyambi. Mbunga thzothzihe ou thza monine eyo nathzo thza shangarire Nyambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Zakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu ou engenine mu Jeriko wa cinakanine mbongi. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Omo kwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Zakiya nduna waterithsi o fumanyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Wa fotire ku mona Yesu ci munu o ngepi, unone wa kwangire mukaci kongi anu no wipi wenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Mweyo, wa cirerire ku rupara no ku ka thzina ku thsitondo thsokuyu ci a mone Yesu ou a pita, inene modiyo dya piterire dikuñwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu ou a kumine mwimi thzathso, wa kengire ku wiru oku a thzinine Zakiya no ku mwithsa pa dithzina dyenthzi ci: “Zakiya, o yokorore o shiruke, naa fota ku kekara mu nthzio thzoe rero.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakiya wa shirukire ko wanguwangu no ku tambura Yesu ko thsinyanyu.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Anu wahe awa i monine a tatekire ku shonaura ci: “Oyu munu ne, o na thzi ku kekara mwenda wa munu o thsivi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakiya wemanine no ku tongwera Fumu ci: “Fumu, o mone, kenge ni tepa pa kaci rufumo rwange, rumweya kenge na ku ru pa ahepwe. Ngeci ko a di oyu na ni shimbera madi ko makupakupa, kenge ni a mu huthseramo rune.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Thzi na tambura kuyoyithsa thzino nthzio rero, pakuninga ci oyu munu naye mwana wa Aburahama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Inene Mwana Munu shime naa keyera ku na fota no ku yoyithsa awa na yongo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kapika o dikumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Anu wahe o kwa teerera eyo o kwa kokera ku Yerusalema, Yesu wa shumunine ku wa tera kathsimo ku wa thsiurura kwianekera yo yo kuninga ci Yesu yoihe a ka kuma pohuma mu Yerusalema Kutumina kwa Nyambi kwaa keya popo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Munu yumweya o ku mukuta o thsifumu wa thzire ku ditunga dyo kure ku ka mu tungithsa pofumu no ku ka huka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />O ku shime ku thza wethsire tango angambenthzi o dikumi no ku pa munu no munu madi o mihorero thzihatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po minasi thzi dipo.</char></note> No ku wa ambera ci: ‘Mu a kwamithse a ku vure, kenge na ku na a wana, ou na ku ka huka.’<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />“Unone anu o mu ditunga dyenthzi a mu thzimbire, a tumine tunganda munyima thzenthzi ku ka amba ci: ‘Ka tu fotire oyu munu ku tu tumina.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Ou a ka pwire ku ka tungithsiwa pofumu, wa ka hukire ku diumbo. Wethsire angambenthzi waya a pire madi ci a mone ci vungashi naa wanenapo munu no munu.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />“O kutanga wa keyire no ku na amba ci: ‘Ñathsire wange, pa madi oe na ni wanenapo dikumi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />“Ñathsire wenthzi wa mu amberire ci: ‘No kwama nawa, owe o ngamba o muwawa! Pakuninga ci no rurama mwinu yoipu, naa ku pa kwikara nokoro peuru thzo maumbo o dikumi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />“O muthsidi naye wa keyire no ku na amba ci: ‘Ñathsire wange, pa madi oe na ni wanenapo mutanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />“Oyu naye ñathsire wenthzi wa mu amberire ci: ‘Nowe naa ku pa ku endithsa mambongi mutanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Ngamba yumweya karo wa keyire no ku na amba ci: ‘Ñathsire wange, madi oe aa, mu katauro na ni a angerera. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Na ni ku yapa pakuninga ci o munu o mukaru, waa shimbanga enu eyi i na ningi ci kadi yoe no ku cora omu no ka na ku kuna.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />“Fumu wa mu amberire ci: ‘Owe o ngamba o mumango, kenge ni ku ratura keyi o na amba. Ngeci no dimuka ci no munu o mukaru oyu na shimbanga enu eyi i ninga ci kadi yange no ku cora omu na ni kana ku kuna, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />ine eyi no kana ku ka a paka aa madi ange mu panga? Uno ni na ka huka nga ni na wanenapo ko peuru.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Wa amberire awa emanine apo ci: ‘Mu a mu nyange, mu a pe oya naa wanenapo madi o peuru o dikumi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />“Awo a mu tawire ci: ‘Ñathsire wetu, oyu po o di noa o dikumi kare.’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Wa wa tawire ci: ‘Munu yomuhe oyu di neyi yoingi kenge a ku vungithsiwerapo. Unone oyu na piri kenge a ku nyangiwa noka kokapu a di nako. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Uno honi naa ambera awa akwethzimbo yange, waya na kana ku fota ci nga ni nekara fumu, mu wa rete kuno mu wepaere pa meho ange o ku ni na wa tanekera.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fumu Yesu aengena mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa wa tangererire ku thza ku Yerusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />O ku kokera mu Betifage na Betania, pa mukinya ou u nethsiwa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera, wa tumine anu aidi perongwa yenthzi. Wa wa amberire ci: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Mu citangethze muya mu diumbo dyo ku rupara, ou mu kengena mu diumbo kenge mu ka wana thsindongiana ethsi thsi na fungereriwa, ethsi a kana ku pahama munu, wangu mu ka thsi puture, mu ka thsi rete kuno. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Yomuhe oyu ka mipura ci: ‘Ine eyi mu thsi putwera?’ Mu ka mu ambere ci: ‘Aa thsi fota Fumu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Awa a tumiwire a ka wanine enu yoihe eci edi a i ambire Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />O kwa putura thsindongiana athsinda wathso a wepurire ci: “Ine eyi mu thsi putwera?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Awo a tawire ci: “Aa thsi fota Fumu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Erongwa ya twarire ethso thsindongiana kwa Yesu. A ka yarirepo ekoveyo yo no ku shimba Yesu ku mu pahamithsapo. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" /><figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' triumphant entry 36" file="lb00315b.tif" size="span" loc="Luk 19:32-36" copy="Louise Bass" ref="19.35-40">Yesu aengena mu Yerusalema</figure>O ku tateka ku enda, anu a yarire ekoveyo yo mu dikuñwa ku rupara.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yesu o ku kokera ku Yerusalema apa dya tatekera dikuñwa ku urumuka ku tunda pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera, erongwa yenthzi yoihe ya tatekire ku tenda muyoyo ko thsinyanyu no ku shangara Nyambi mukaci kekomokithsa yoikuru eyi ya monine ci:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Wa thsiyauthzi Fumu oyu keya mu dithzina dya Nyambi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Mem 118.26</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">thsiyaro thsikare mu diwiru no kutethzima kwikare kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Afarithsi awa ekarire mukaci ko mbunga a amberire Yesu ci: “Murongithsi, o kuturure erongwa yoe i tutware.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Aye wa wa amberire ci: “Shaanga o i tutware, aa mawe kenge a kuerera.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa direrera Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu ou a kokerire mu Yerusalema no ku mona mbongi, wa thzi dirererire ci: <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />“Mayuwane owe kwanu wahe, nga o na dimuka rero pano eyi nga ya ku ku retera thsiyaro! Unone honi i na horekiwa ku meho oe. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Mwao mayuwa akwethzimbo yoe kenge a ku keya ku na ku thzinguruka ku ku paka mu thsipaka, ku ku paka mu kaci ku ku yanthzera kokuhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Kenge a ku ku umburura no kwipaa anoe awa di mu kaci koe. Kwithsa diwe edi dya ku thsiara o ku di di peuru thzo diwe dimweya, inene ko no nangura thsiya thsikati naa keya Nyambi ku koe, ku na ku yoyithsa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa thza ku Tembere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu ou engenine mu Tembere wa cithzacithzire awa a urithseriremo. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa kenge ci: ‘Nthzio thzange po nthzio thzerombero,’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56.7</ref>.</char></note> uno honi amwe mwaa thzi pirura macihoreko ethzi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7.11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu wekarangire mu Tembere diyuwa no diyuwa o ku rongithsa. Akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao nakuru o mbunga a fotire ku mwipaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Unone ka wanine thsikati nawa, inene mbunga shime thza koñomekire ku mu teerera.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aepuriwa pokoro wenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu o ku rongithsa mu Tembere no ku tongwera anu Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi, akuru o mapurisita, arongithsi o murao nakuru, a keyire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />A ambire ci: “O tu tongwere, eyi o kwama ne wa i kwama kokoro wa dye? Edye naa ku pa oo okoro?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Wa tawire ci: “Tango ni mipure ngudi, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />ene okoro wa Johani o ku korovethza ne waa tunda ku wiru nji kwanu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />A ciyongorire mu kaciko no ku amba ci: “Ngeci o tu ninge ci ‘Waa tunda ku wiru,’ kenge a twipura ci: ‘Ine eyi na mu kana ku tawa yenthzi?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Karo ngeci o tu ninge ci ‘Waa tunda kwanu,’ anu wahe kenge a tu povaura no mawe, inene awopo aa rakwa ci Johani po mukwakukethza.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Mweyo, a tawire ci: “Ka tu dimukire oku wa tundire.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Name ka ni mi tongwera oku u tunderera ou okoro ni kwamithsa eyi enu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kakwakunyunga dikanda owamango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu wa terire anu aka kathsimo ci: “Mukwerume yumweya wa dimine dikanda dyo veine, wa di pire mu moko anjimi amweya no ku thza ku ditunga dyo kure oku a kekarire myaka thzothzingi.”<figure style="fig" alt="Cluster of grapes" file="hk00111b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luk 20:9-12" copy="Knowles" ref="20.9-12">Thsikocera thso veine</figure> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Pa thsikati thso ku koyora veine wa tumineko mupikenthzi ko waya anjimi ci a ka mu shimbereko ku veine oyu na koyora muya mu dikanda. Unone awo anjimi a ka mu furire no ku mu huthsa mokomoko. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Wa tumineko mupikenthzi yumweya, unone naye karo a ka mu furire no ku mu kwama omango no ku mu huthsa mokomoko. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Wa tumineko o muthsihatu, awopo a ka mu kurura no ku mu cithzacithza ku mu tundithsa mu dikanda.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Unone thsinda thsa dikanda wa cipurire ci: “Ngepi na ku tenda? Kenge na ku tumako mwanange pakamutwa oyu na shima nene, kuinashimi kenge a ku ka mu remeka.”<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Unone awo anjimi ou a mu monine, a ciyongorire ci: “Na kumu shwana, tu mwipaenu twa ku shwane dikanda dyo veine.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />A mu tundithsire mu dikanda dyo veine no ku mwipaera ku nganga thzo dikanda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Thsine a ku kwama oya thsinda thsa dikanda dyo veine ko waya anjimi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Naa mi ambera ci kenge a ku keya no ku na wepaa waya anjimi no ku shimba dikanda dyo veine ku di paka mu moko anjimi amweya.” Anu ou a i yuvire a ambire ci: “Mbera ya tendahara.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu wa wa tanekerire no ku amba ci: “Eyi i na ñoriwa ne yaa tongora ine yo ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Diwe edi na kende akwakuumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">di na piruka diunthzi dyo nthzio.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mem 118.22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Munu yomuhe o ku werapo kenge a ku cinathzoka tupinthzipinthzi, oyu dya ku wera kenge dya ku mwororora.<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu aepura yo ku tera mutero kwa Sesare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Arongithsi o murao nakuru o mapurisita a fotire dyo kwanga Yesu wanguwangu, inene a dimukire ci ako kathsimo po ka shembo thzo ku thsangera ku kwo, unone a yapire anu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />A fotire thsikati thso ku kwata Yesu, aendithsi ngou a tumine matikitivi kwa Yesu awa a cimonaharithsire eci awawa. Shime a mu tire pa rudimi ci a ka mu kwatithse kwa nguvuru o Muroma.<verse eid="LUK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Aa matikitivi a mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi, tu na dimuka ci waa ambanga no ku rongithsa yoshemwa. Karo tu na dimuka ci ko wa wana mavwevwe, unone waa rongithsanga ko shemwa dikuñwa dya Nyambi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />O tu tongwere, ene yaa tawethziwa ci atwe tu tere mutero kwa Sesare nji ngepi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Unone Yesu wa dimukire dinyanyamena dyo, ngou a wa amberire ci: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Mu ni monithse muwayawaya. Ethsi thsikupuro nodi dithzina i dipo ne yadye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">A mu tawire ci: “Ya Sesare.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu wa wa huthsire ci: “I na roo, mu pe Sesare ya Sesare, no Nyambi mu mu pe ya Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />A kwangire ku mu kwata ko mangudi komu a wa tawerire pa meho anu. A komokire edi a wa tawire, awopo a tutwara.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaduki aepura yo kupinduka kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Asaduki, anu o kukana ku tawa ci ko ku di kupinduka kwafu, a keyire kwa Yesu ku na mwipura. A ambire ci: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Murongithsi, Mushe wa tu pire murao o kenge ci: ‘Ngeci mukwerume aa fa ku thsia munuwenthzi ko kupira ana, mukurwe nji minenthzi aa roera ku mu yeka ci erekere minenthzi nji mukurwe ana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Unone honi kwekarire ana munu yofoci o mutanu naidi wakwerume. O kutanga wa yekire mbuyama no ku fa o ku shime ku wana nenthzi ana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />O muthsidi <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />noyu o muthsihatu wahe a mu yekire mane wahe mu dira dyo akwa mutanu naidi a mu yekire no ku fa, unone kwithsa shaanga yofoci oyu wa wanine nenthzi ana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kuhura naye mbuyama wa fire. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />O tu tongwere, oya mbuyama mu diyuwa dyo kupinduka kwafu ne kenge a kwikara munu wadye, inene wahe akwa mutanu naidi a mu yekire?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Anu o kano kaye aa ciyeka. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Unone anu o kaye aka ka keya, awa na roera ku pinduka kwafu mbera ka yeke nji ku yekithsiwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Mbera ka fu karo, inene kenge mbekara eci tungeru. Awopo ana Nyambi, inene kenge mba pindukera mwoyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Kokuthza keyi yo kupinduka kwafu, no Mushe aa monithsa nawanawa mwiambaura yo thsipukumuna o ku thsi yuuma. Aethsa Fumu ci Nyambi wa Aburahama, Nyambi wa Isaka no Nyambi wa Jakovo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Diya 3.6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Eyi yaa monithsa ci aye po kadi Nyambi wa afu, unone Nyambi wayumi, inene ku kwenthzi wahe ayumi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Arongithsi o murao amweya a ambire ci: “O na amba nawa murongithsi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ku tunda apo karo kwithsa oyu wa keshukire ku mwipura mangudi amweya.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesiya ne mwana edye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Ine eyi a na ambangera ci Mesiya po Mwana Davida?” <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Davida yothsinda wa ñorire mu vuka thzo Membo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Fumu wa amberire Fumu wange ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">‘O wikare ku dyoko dyange dyo rudyo.<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Ku ka kuma mu diyuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">edi na ku pirura akwethzimbo yoe thsipura thso mauru oe.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mem 110.1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />“Ngeci Davida aethsa Mesiya ci Fumu wenthzi, ngepi karo edi nga ekara mwanenthzi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa shomorora arongithsi o murao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Anu wahe o kwa teerera, Yesu wa thsiurukerire kwirongwa yenthzi no ku amba ci: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mu mamere arongithsi o murao, aa thzimbanga ku endaura mu makuñwa o kwa na vata evata yoire no ku fota ku vumeneniwa ko direma mu maurithsero. Aa cihangweranga epura yo direma mu masinagoge no kwikara mu mandau o direma pedika. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Aa pupirikanga mafakathzi no ku wethzera mu manthzio o ko mahetaheta o ku wa tenderanga erombero yoire. Humbithso thzo kenge thza kwikara thzothzikuru.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Nupu thza difakathzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu o ku di mu Tembere wa tanekerire afumanyi o kwa konthzera nupu thzo mu kakoño. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Karo wa monine difakathzi o hepwe o ku konthzeramo tuwayawaya twidi totuonye. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci oyu difakathzi o hepwe nupu thzenthzi thzi na piti thzanu wahe. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Inene wahe po shime a na pa ekunda yo ku tundithsa poyi yoshongi a di nayo, uno honi aye muhepwe wenthzi na pakamo kokahe apa a na roera ku yoyera.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwipa ko Tembere nekati yo mahurerero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Erongwa imweya shime ya ambaurire yo Tembere, edi thza yengiwire ko mawe oawa no nupu ethzi thza piwire Nyambi. Yesu wa ambire ci: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Yoihe eyi mu mona thsikati thsaa keya apa ya ku shandathzokera, kwithsa diwe edi dya kwikara peuru thzedi dimweya.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikarara no kunyandithsiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ya mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi, eyo ne diyuwa dipi ya ku tendahara? Thsine thsa kwikara thsimonithso ci pepi i di no ku tendahara?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Mu mamere ci mwa kwangeriwa, inene owangi kenge a ku keya mu dithzina dyange no ku amba ci: ‘Yame no Mesiya!’ karo ‘no thsikati thsi na kumu!’ Unone mwa ku wa shupwera. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mwa ku yapa ou mwa ku yuva yo mamvo netaraka. Inene eyo yaa roera ku tanga ku tendahara, uno honi kupwa ko kaye ka kwa ku keya popo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Ditunga kenge dya ku cirwithsa no ditunga dimweya, no kutumina kenge kwa ku cirwithsa no kutumina kumweya.” <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kungangama kokukuru ko kaye, ndombo nekora yo kwipaa yo ku yambukera kenge ya kwikara mu mandau oangi, yo ku yapithsa nemonithso yo ku wiru kenge ya kwikarako.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />O ku i shime ku keya yoihe eyo kenge a ku mi kwata no ku mi nyandithsa mu masinagoge no ku mi paka mu tumenga. Kenge a ku mi twara ku mafumu naendithsi mukaci kange. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ethso thsodiyo thsikati thsothsiwa ethsi mwa ku twethsa ku pa ombangi o dithzina dyange. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mweyo, mu ture micima, mwa cithzekera cimo edi mwa ku amba ko ku ciamwena mwathsinda. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Inene ame kenge na ku mi pa maywi nonyanyami ci kwa kupire shaanga yofoci kwakwethzimbo yenu oyu wa ku twethsa ku mi kanana nji ku hamura eyi mwa ku amba. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Kenge a ku mi omba ashemienu, akuruenu naminenu, apenu nambushenu, karo kenge a kwipaako amweya ku kwenu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Anu wahe kenge a ku mi thzimba mukaci kange. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Unone shaanga kengeyo kwithsa dihuki shaanga dyofoci dyo ku mitwi thzenu edi dya ku yongako. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kothzui wenu kenge mwa ku yoyithsa myoyo thzenu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba yo ku shandoka kwa Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Apa mbo mu mona Yerusalema o ku na thzingurukiwa ku mashwarare oangi mu dimuke ci kwipa kwenthzi pepi ku di. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Popo awa di mu Judea a ku cirere ku mikinya, awa di mu Yerusalema a ku tundemo, awa kwikara mu murundu katere a ku ka huke ku diumbo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ao po odiyo mayuwa a Nyambi o ditoto, ci i citombore yoihe eyi ya ñoriwire. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Mayuwane othsimo wambuyama awa kwikara poremu nowa ku yamwithsa mwao mayuwa, inene pa kaye kenge pa kwikara dikarara karo Nyambi kenge a ku anthzipera nene anu. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Kenge a kwipaiwa ko myere, matunga oahe a ku wa kupare, karo anukenge a ku dyaterere Yerusalema shime thsikati thso ou thsa ku pwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya kwa Mwana Munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Emonithso kenge ya kwikara pa diyuwa, pa ngonda no pa matungwethzi, matunga pa kaye kenge a ku cithzekera no ku yapa muvumo no mañithsingi o diwate. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Anu kenge a ku pwerera muñupe ko wowa o ku anekera eyi ya ku keya pa kaye, inene yoshokoro yo mu wiruwiru kenge ya ku ngangamithsiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Mwethso thsikati anu wahe kenge a ku mona Mwana Munu o ku keya mu divui kokoro no kutethzima kokukuru. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ou ya ku tateka ku tendahara yoihe eyi mwa kwimane no ku diamena ku wiru, inene kupaturiwa kwenu pepi ku di.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo thsitondo thsokuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesu wa wa tererire kathsimo ci: “Mu mone thsitondo thsokuyu netondo yoihe. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Kamona i mena mamuna yoyamwe mwathsinda mwaa dimuka ci mvura pepi a di. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Mofoci, ou mwa ku mona yoihe eyi o ku i tendahara mu dimuke ci Kutumina kwa Nyambi pepi ku di.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci awa yoya thsino thsikati ka ku fererera wahe eyi enu o ku i shime ku tendahara. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Diwiru no kaye kenge ya ku pwa uno honi diywi dyange adyo mbera ka di pu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu mamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mu mamere micima thzenu ci katere thzi anekere pohuma yedika no mawarwa necoyoka yo mwoyo, ci edi diyuwa katere dya ku mi wane ko thsiundumukera. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Inene edi diyuwa kenge dya ku wera anu o kano kaye eci thsimbande. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mu taterere o ku mu rombera thsikati thsothsihe ci mwa ku wane okoro o ku para kweyi ya ku keya yoihe no ku kemana pa rupara rwa Mwana Munu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Ao mayuwa ao Yesu shime a rongithsangerire mu Tembere mutenya, othsiku shime ekarangire pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Anu wahe shime a menekerangire ku Tembere ku ka teerera ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kayongo ko kwipaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Thsidika thso Makende o kupira Mamene ethsi thsi nethsiwa ci Paseka o ku thsi di po pepi no ku tendahara, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao a cekire dyo kwipaa Yesu, unone shime a yapire anu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Judasi aa tawa ku omba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Satana wa tumaurire Judasi Isikariota yumweya o tunganda twa Yesu to dikumi na twidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Judasi ngou a thzire kwakuru o mapurisita no kwitumi yakwakunyunga Tembere ku ka cekano edi nga a twethsa ku omba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Judasi wa wa nyanyukithsire nene shime a mu kumbwethza ku mu pa madi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Judasi wa tawire ngou a fotire thsikati thsothsiwa thso ku omba Yesu oku ku na piri mbunga.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murarero o mahurerero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ou dya kumine diyuwa dyo Paseka dyo Makende o kupira Mamene, apa paerangire dinguana dyo thsiyambero, <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu wa tumine a Peturu na Johani ku rupara rwenthzi no ku wa ambera ci: “Mu thze mu ka roithse murarero wetu o Paseka”.<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />A mwipurire ci: “Kupi oku o na foto ci tu ka u roithsereko?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Wa wa tawire ci: “Ou mwingena mu Yerusalema kenge a ka mi shambawera mukwerume oyu na shimbi kafuma ko meyu, mu ka mu shupwere mu kengene mu nthzio omu a kengena. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mu ka ambere thsinda thsa nthzio ci: ‘Murongithsi aepura ci: Kupi oku ka di kapingwethzi kenda oku nga a dyera thsidika thso Paseka nerongwa yenthzi?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Kenge a ka mi twara ku koroi thzothzikuru oku ku di yo ku cikwathsithsa yoihe, kodiyo mu ka kwamena murarero wetu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />A thzire no ku ka wana enu yoihe eci edi a i wa tongwerire Yesu. A kwamine murarero o Paseka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murarero wa Fumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Last Supper 22" file="wa03909b.tif" size="col" loc="Luk 22:14-20" copy="Graham Wade" ref="22.14-20">Murarero o mahurerero</figure>Thsikati ou thsa kumine Yesu wa keyire ku nekara ku tafure no tunganda twenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Wa ambire ci: “Kuma na ni foto nenenene ku dya nenu uno murarero o Paseka o ku ni shime ku nyanda. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Naa mi tongwera ci ka na ku dya nenu karo uno murarero shime ou ya ku tenda ku citombora mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Yesu wa shimbire nganja thzo waine no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi, ayepo amba ci: “Mu shimbe mu humburangemo mwahe. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Naa mi tongwera ci ka na ku nwa waine karo shime Kutumina kwa Nyambi ou kwa ku keya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Wa shimbire dikende no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi, wa di kuyaurire no ku di pa erongwa yenthzi, no ku amba ci: “Eyi po erama yange eyi i piwa mukaci kenu, mu tendange kengeyo ci mu ni vurukerangepo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Mofoci, munyima thzo murarero wa shimbire nganja thzo waine, wa ambire ci: “Ethsi po thsiyuvano thsothsipe ethsi thsi na angiwa konyinga wange ou wa ku mwaarera amwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Uno honi mu mone, pano pa tafure tu di pa a di oyu wa ku ni omba. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ii, Mwana Munu kenge a ku fa eci edi a i raire Nyambi, unone o di nothsimo oyu wa ku mu omba.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Erongwa ya tatekire ku cipura mu kaci kayo ci edye honi oyu wa ku tenda eyi?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikanyi dyo kuninga ci o mukuru mu kaciko ne edye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kwa katukire dikanyi dyo ku ninga ci edye o mukuru mu kaciko. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mafumu Anukenge a di nokoro peuru thzanu, naendithsi a ethsiwa ambusha anu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ku kwenu po ka ku di kengeyo, o mukuru ku kwenu a cipiture noyu o muonye, muendithsi apwe eci mupika. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />O mukuru ne yupi, noyu di ku tafure ku dya noyu reta edya ku tafure? Kadi oyu di ku tafure? Unone ame po naekara mu kaci kenu ko kwikara oyu na mi kwamena. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Amwe po na mwikara nange mwiereka yange yoihe. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Dyodi naa ni pa Tata Kutumina, name kenge na ku mi pa okoro <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />o ku dya no ku nwa nange pa tafure thzange mu Kutumina kwange. Karo kenge mwa kwikara mu mangunja ku ratura mikuta thzo dikumi na thzidi thza Isiraele.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ambera Peturu ci kenge a mu hamura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni, o teerere! Satana na rombo ku mi ereka mwaheno ci a mi yererekethze eci vuroto. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Unone ni na ku romberera Simoni ci thsitawo thsoe katere thsi pwe. Uno no cera no ku huka ku kwange o koropithse nowe aenthzoe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Peturu wa tawire ci: “Fumu, ni na ciroithsera kwingena mu kamenga no ku fa noe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Peturu, naa ku tongwera ci ñombwe o ku shime kwiya o ku na ni hamura ruhatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu wa ipurire ci: “Uya na mi tumine ko kupira thsipaupau, mukotana nji mashangu ne shime mwaa ka pira thsimweya nji?” Ya tawire ci: “Kwithsa ethsi twa ka pirire.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Wa i amberire ci: “Pano honi oyu di no thsipaupau nji mukotana a shimbe, oyu na piri mwere a urithse thsikoveyo thsenthzi a ure mwere. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Naa mi tongwera ci yoihe eyi ya ñoriwire keyi yange shime ou ya ku tendahara, yo kuninga ci: ‘O na variwera kwikeremi.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53.12</ref>.</char></note> Ii, yoihe yange eyi a ñorire akwakukethza shime ou ya kwikara yoshemwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Erongwa ya ambire ci: “Fumu, o na mono tu di no myere thzidi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Aye wa i tawire ci: “Ku na kwana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rombera pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Eci edi a kwamangire, Yesu wa tundire mu mbongi nerongwa yenthzi ku thza ku Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ou a ka kumineko, Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mu rombere ci katere mwingene mwiereka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Wa i thsiire kamanana no ku ka tongama ku manwi no ku rombera ci: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tata, ngeci o na i shimi o tundithse ethzi nganja thzo makando ku kwange. Unone shaanga kengeyo o tende omu o na shimena owe kadi omu ni na shimena ame.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ngou kwa keyire kangeru ko ku tunda ku wiru ku na mu tanarithsa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Omo mu dikarara dyodikuru, wa romberire nene no ku yuywera diyuywa dyo ku pitura eci onyinga edi dya hoyerire pashi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ou a manine ku rombera wa katukire no ku huka kwirongwa yenthzi, no ku ka i wana o ku i na rara, mukaci ko ku aya no mathsiwa oakuru. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Ine eyi mu na rarera, mu pinduke mu rombere ci katere mwingene mu thsitumaura.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kwatiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Joh 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />O ku amba eyi, mbunga thzanu thza kumine ethzi a tangererire Judasi thsimweya thserongwa ya Yesu yo dikumi naidi, Judasi wa thzerererire kwa Yesu no ku ka mu vumenena ko ku mu yamwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Unone Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Judasi, ene waa omba Mwana Munu ko ku mu yamwa nji?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Erongwa eyi yekarire na Yesu ou ya monine eyi ya fotire ku tendahara ya ambire ci: “Fumu, ene tu rwe ko myere thzetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumweya werongwa wa tetire ditwi dyo ku rudyo dya mupika mupurisita shokuru.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Unone Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mu thsie eyo!” Wa kwatire ku ditwi dyoya munu no ku mu porithsa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesu wa amberire akuru o mapurisita netumi yakwakunyunga Tembere nakuru awa keyire ku na mu kwata ci: “Ine eyi mu na keyera no myere no miramu eci no mwithzi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Ine na mu kana ku ni kwatera mu Tembere muya na nikaranga nenu diyuwa no diyuwa, unone honi thsino po thsikati thsenu no thsikati thsokoro o mirema.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa hamura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Joh 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />A kwatire Yesu no ku mu twara ku nthzio thza mupurisita shokuru. Peturu wa shupwerire Yesu o ku enderanga kokure nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Pa kaci ko dirapa shime a fakarirepo mudiro no kwikara ku u thzinguruka, Peturu naye wa keyire no ku nekarano. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ngamba yumweya o mbuyamaana wa mu monine o ku nekara ku diyeye dyo mudiro, wa mu kengererire thsithzui no ku amba ci: “Oyu naye shime naa endanga na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Unone Peturu wa tawire ci: “Mama, ka ni mu dimuka ame.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu, munu yumweya wa mu monine, wa amberire ci: “Nowe o mukwa thsipani thsoyu munu oyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Unone Peturu wa tawire ci: “Kadi no mukwa thsipani thsenthzi ame.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ou kwa pitire thsitunde, munu yumweya karo mu kaci wa ooterire nene Peturu ci: “Yoshemwa oyu munu oyu shime a ekaranga na Yesu, inene naye oyu Mugalilea.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Napo karo Peturu wa kanine no ku amba ci: “Owe mukwerume, ka ni dimuka eyo amba ci ine. Popa a ambire kengeyo ñombwe weyire.” <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Fumu wa cithsetukire no ku kenga Peturu. Popo Peturu wa vurukire maywi a Fumu Yesu aa a mu amberire o ku ninga ci: “Rero ñombwe o ku shime kwiya owe o ku o na ni hamura miendo thzihatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Peturu wa punine pora no ku ka cithziurura ku dira.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa teururiwa no ku furiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Anu awa a nyungire Yesu a tatekire ku mu teurura no ku mu fura. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />A mu angire pa meho no ku mwipura ci: “O ukethze! Edye oya ku fura?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Anu a ambire maywi oangi o ku mu yengwera.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa mwipura aendithsi o Majuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Joh 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Anaci mathsiku, akuru o mbunga, akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao a ciwanine pofoci, Yesu a mu retire mu Nthzango thzo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />A mwipurire ci: “O tu tongwere, ene yowe o Mesiya nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Shaanga o ni mi tongwere ci yame ka mu tawa. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Karo shaanga o ni mipure ka mu ni tawa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Unone honi ku tunda pano Mwana Munu kenge a kwikara ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi shokoro.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />A mwipurire wahe ci: “Ene yowe o Mwana Nyambi nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Aye wa wa tawire ci: “Ii, dyodi mu na amba yame.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />A ambire ci: “Ombangi wine ou tu fota karo? Tu na ciyuvera twahe mu kanwa kenthzi o ku amba.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pa kuta thza Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joh 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Mbunga thzothzihe thzemanine no ku twara Yesu kwa Pilatu nguvuru o Muroma. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />A tatekire ku mu capa eamba ci: “Kuma na tu wana oyu munu o ku pambanithsa ditunga dyetu. Aa kanithsa anu ku tera mutero kwa Sesare, karo aa cithsa ci Mesiya o fumu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilatu ngou a mwipurire ci: “Ene yowe o fumu o Majuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ii, o na amba.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilatu wa thsiurukerire kwakuru o mapurisita no ku mbunga no ku wa ambera ci: “Ka ni mu wanenine murandu oyu munu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Unone a thsimbekerire ku amba ci: “Aa reta mikwangarakanyi mu kaci kanu mukaci kerongithsa yenthzi. Shimes naa tatekera ku Galilea no ku nengena mu Judea yomuhe, rero pano ngono muno mu Yerusalema.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pa kuta thza Heroda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilatu ou a i yuvire eyi wepurire ci: “Epo oyu munu po Mugalilea?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ou a dimukire ci Yesu po aa tunda mu ndau ethzi thzi di mukoro wa Heroda, wa mu tumithsire ku kwenthzi o ku di naye mu Yerusalema kethsiya thsikati.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Heroda wa nyanyukire nene ou a monine Yesu, inene wa shimbire thsikati thsothsire o ku cikumbwethzanga ci nga na mu mono. Inene wa yuvire keyi yenthzi, wa kuruperire ku mu mona o ku kwama thsimonithso. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Heroda wepurire Yesu mangudi oangi, unone aye ka a mu tawire thsimweya. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao a henyenineko no ku capa Yesu eamba yoingi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Heroda no mashwarare enthzi a varaerire Yesu no ku mu teurura. A mu shupekire thsikoveyo thso thsifumu, a mu huthserire karo kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ku tunda edyo diyuwa Pilatu na Heroda a tatekire ku ciyuva no ku piruka anu na mbushe, kukare po shime cithzimbire.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ratweriwa kufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joh 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilatu wethsire akuru o mapurisita no manduna nanu wahe. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Mu na ni retera oyu munu ci shime naa pambanithsa anu. Ni na mwipura o ku mu na ciyuvera mwaheno, ame ka ni wanine murandu peyi eamba mu na mu capa. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />No Heroda ka a ka mu wanenine murandu ngeyi a na ka mu huthsera ku kwetu. Kwithsa ethsi a na kwama ethsi nga epaiwera. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Kenge ni mu fura pohuma wangu ni mu rukurure.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[Ko thsikati no thsikati thso Paseka, Pilatu shime a wa punithserangire thsinthzinda.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Unone mbunga thzothzihe thza yoomokire ku amba ci: “O mwipae oyo munu oyo! O tu punithsere Barabasi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabasi shime a pakiwire mu kamenga ko murandu o mukwangaranyi o mu mbongi neamba yo kwipaa munu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pakuninga ci Pilatu shime a fotire ku thsia Yesu, wepurire anu karo. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Unone a twarererire ku kumba ci: “Ambiwe pa mbinda! Ambiwe pa mbinda!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilatu wa hukerire ku wepura ro muthsihatu ci: “Ene ine a nepithsa? Ka ni monine murandu o ku mwipaera. Kenge ni mu fura pohuma wangu ni mu thsie.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Unone wahe a yoomokire nene ku amba ci ambiwe pa mbinda. Ku hura muyoyo wo wa othzire Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilatu ngou a ratwerire Yesu kokuthza komu thza foterire mbunga. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Wa punithsire munu oyu a fotire, oya wa pakiwire mu kamenga ko mukwangaranyi neamba yo kwipaa munu, no ku wa pa Yesu ci a ka mu kwame omu a foterire.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a ambiwa pa mbinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus walking to be crucified 26" file="wa03924b.tif" size="span" loc="Luk 23:26-31" copy="Graham Wade" ref="23.26-31">Yesu aa mu twara ku ka mwamba</figure>O kwa mu twara kengeyo, a hanganine mukwerume o dithzina dyo Simoni o ku diumbo edi di nethsiwa Sirene, o ku ka tunda ku dikanda dyenthzi. A mu ooterire ku shimba mbinda munyima thza Yesu o kwa ka thza. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu shupwerire nambuyama awa a thzire o mu dira no ku kuana. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu wa cithsetukire no ku amba ci: “Amwe mwambuyama o mu Yerusalema, mwa direra ame, unone mu cidirerere amwe no ku direrera anenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Inene thsikati thsaa keya, anu kenge a ku amba ci: ‘Akwa thsiyauthzi ambuyama wamvumi, awa a kana kwereka nowa a kana ku yamwithsa.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Kethsiya thsikati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">“ ‘anu kenge a ku ambera mikinya ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">“Mu tu were!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">Karo kenge a ku ambera ehumba ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">“Mu tu thsike!” ’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10.8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />“Inene ngeci anu aa kwama eyi ku thsitondo thsothsiyu, ngepi ya kwikara honi ku thsitondo thsothsikukutu?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />A shimbire akwerume aidi wekeremi ci a ka wepaere pofoci na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ou a kumine pa ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa katendere, podiyo a ka mwamberire mu kaci kekeremi idi, thsimweya ku rudyo, thsimweya ku rumoho. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Tata, o wa tetere, inene ka dimukire eyi a tenda.” Karo a cieraerire evata yenthzi ko ku pepa ñera.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Mbunga athzo thza tanekerire eyi ya tendaharire, naendithsi a mu teururire. A ambire ci: “Kuma naa yoyithsanga amweya, a ciyoyithse naye ngeci yodiyo shemwa Mesiya wa Nyambi, aye O Kuhanguriwa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Mashwarare nawo a mu teururire, a keyire ku na mu pa waine o kuwawata. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />A ambire ci: “Ngeci yowe o fumu o Majuda o ciyoyithse.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Peuru thzo mutwi wenthzi a pamarerirepo thsidimukithso ethsi thsa ñoriwire ci: “Oyu po Fumu o Majuda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumweya wekeremi oyu a pamarerire pa mbinda ku mbadi thzenthzi, wa mu yengwerire kuninga ci: “Ene kadi yowe o Krisitu? O ciyoyithse no ku yoyithsa natwe kengeyo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Unone thsiya thsikeremi thsimweya thsa mu kutururire ci: “Ine yo kukana ku yapa Nyambi? A na tu ratwera raturo thzofoci nenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Unone atwe raturo thzetu thzaa tu roera, inene atwe po na tu waniwa no murandu weyi na tu kwama yoimango. Aye po kwithsa thsothsimango ethsi naa kwama.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ngou a rombire Yesu ci: “Yesu, wa ku ni vuruke ou wa ku keya mu Kutumina koe.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci rero kenge o kekara nange mu paradaisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ku tunda diyuwa o ku di di pa kaci ko mutwi mirema thza thsikire ditunga dyodihe mwitunde ihatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Diyuwa dya nyorire, no dimbatu dyo mu Tembere dya yaturiwire pa kaci. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu wa karumukire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Tata, naa paka mwoyo wange mu moko oe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Mem 31.5</ref>.</char></note> Ou a manine ku amba kengeyo wa minine mwoyo no ku fa.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ou a monine eyi ya tendaharire wa shangarire Nyambi no ku amba ci: “Yoshemwa oyu munu nedi munu o muwawa ka a di no murandu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Anu wahe awa a keyire ku na kengerera ou a monine eyi ya tendaharire, a hukire ku maumbo o kwa ka thza o nyunga mitwi ko thsinyengo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Unone wahe awa a dimukire nawa Yesu no waya ambuyama a mu shupwerire ku tunda mu Galilea, emanine koshore o kwa tanekera eyi ya tendaharire yoihe.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa vumbekiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Josefa o ku mbongi thza Arimatea. Nedi yumweya o mu Nthzango thzo Majuda, karo wekarire munu o muwawa, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />oyu wa tatererire Kutumina kwa Nyambi. Unone shaanga ci wekarire yumweya o manduna o mu Nthzango thzo Majuda, ka a vandire kwianekera netenda yaenthzenthzi. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Wa thzire kwa Pilatu ku ka romba thsithzimbi thsa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Wa ka tururire thsithzimbi pa mbinda no ku thsi vungera pa dimbatu dyo lineni. Wa thsi shimbire no ku ka thsi paka mu thsidi thsothsipe omu mwa kana ku pakiwa munu, ethsi a cakurire mu diwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Eyi yoihe ya tendaharire mu Diyuwa dyOciroithsero, o ku di fota ku tateka diyuwa dyo Savata.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Ambuyama waya shupwerire Yesu ku tunda mu Galilea, a thzire na Josefa ku mararo ci a ka mone edi a ka paka thsithzimbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Munyima thzeyo, a hukire ku diumbo ku ka ciroithserera ehefu no thsende yo ku ka wethsa thsithzimbi. Unone shime a turumwithsire dyo Savata ko shupwera thsiraerera.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa pinduka kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Mu diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda, ruura awo ambuyama a shimbire ehefu no thsende eyi a ciroithserire no ku thza ku thsidi. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />A ka wanine diwe dyo ku thsero thzo thsidi o ku di na arumuniwako. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Engenine mu thsidi, unone ka waninemo erama ya Fumu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />O kwa i cikomokera kengeyo popo kwa keyire akwerume aidi awa a vatire ekoveyo yo kutethzima, emanine ku nyonga thzowa ambuyama.<verse eid="LUK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ko ku yapa nene a kupamine pashi, unone awo akwerume aidi a wepurire ci: “Ine eyi mu fotera o muyumi kwafu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ka a dimo muno o na pinduka, mu vuruke eyi a mi amberire mu Galilea ci: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Mwana Munu aa roera ku piwa mu moko anu wevi, no ku mwamba pa mbinda, unone mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu kenge a ku pinduka kwafu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Popo nawo ambuyama a vurukire maywi a Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />A tundire pa thsidi no ku ka tongwera tunganda to dikumi na kofoci no ku kwamweya wahe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Nedi Madiya Magadalena, Joana, Madiya mama wa Jakovo nambuyama amweya, awa a tongwerire tunganda eyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Unone ka tawire eyi a wa amberire ambuyama, awo ci kuyavayava kwo pohuma. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Unone Peturu wa katukire ku cirera ku thsidi no ku ka kotama ku hokera mu thsidi, wa ka monine dimbatu dyo lineni apa a vungerire Yesu. Ngou a ka hukire ku diumbo, o ku na cikomokera eyi ya tendaharire.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongwa idi ya Yesu o ku i thza ku Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Dyodyo diyuwa, erongwa idi kwirongwa ya Yesu shime ya thzire ku diumbo edi di nethsiwa ci Emausi, tunano to ku kwana dikumi na kofoci ku tunda mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Shime ya thzire o ambaura yoihe eyi ya tendaharire. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />O ku i ambaura kengeyo no ku cipaura, aye Yesu wa henyenine ku kwayo no ku enderera nayo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ya mu monine, unone ka ya mu dimukire.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu wa ipurire ci: “Ine eyi mu thza o ambaura o ku mu enda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Yemanine ko mathsiwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Thsimweya ethsi thsi nethsiwa Kleopa thsa mwipurire ci: “Ene yowe o mwenda pohuma oyu di mu Yerusalema oyu na kana ku dimuka ethsi na thsi tendahara mo aya mayuwa naa pu nji?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Aye wa ipurire ci: “Enu mwine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Ya tawire ci: “Eyi ya Yesu wa Nazareta. Nedi mukwakukethza o mukoro mu ku amba netenda pa meho a Nyambi nanu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Akuru o mapurisita etu naendithsi o mbunga na mu shimbi no ku ka mu ratwera kufa, awopo a mwamba pa mbinda. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Atwe shime na tu kurupera ci yodiyo wa ku patura Maisiraele. Unone kwithsa, rero dyoo muthsihatu ku tunda apa na i tendaharera eyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Karo ambuyama amweya ku kwetu a na tu komokithsa. Shime a na menekera ku mararo mathsikuthsiku shemwa, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />unone ka ka wanine thsithzimbi thsa Yesu. Ou a na ka huka a na tu tongwera ci a na mono thsimona thso tungeru otu tu na amba ci mu yumi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Amweya kowa nekara netu shime aa thza ku mararo no ku ka wana eci edi a na tongora ambuyama, unone aye ka ka mu monine.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mayuwane amwe mwanu o kupira maano no kukana ku tawa wangu eyi na amba akwakukethza. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ene ka na i roera ci Mesiya a nyandithsiwe kengeyo o ku shime kwingena mu kutethzima kwenthzi nji?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yesu ayepo i tongonwena eyi ya ambiwire mu Mañoro keyi yenthzi. Wa tatekire koa a Mushe mane shime ku na kuma koa akwakukethza wahe.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ou a kokerire ku diumbo Yesu wa ningire eci a piterera. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Unone ya mwindire, ya ambire ci: “O kume netu mu diumbo wa piterera othsiku uno.” Ayepo thza nayo.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />O ku nekara nayo ku tafure, wa shimbire dikende no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi, wa di kuyaurire no ku i pa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Popo ya kathsukire pa meho no ku mu dimuka, ayepo i thsevuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ya ambire ci: “Kandi yodiyo thzi na pianena micima thzetu eci mudiro uya a na ambaura yo Mañoro mu dikuñwa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Popo ya hukire ku Yerusalema, ya ka wanine tunganda to dikumi na kofoci namweya o kwa di pofoci nato <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />awa a ambire ci: “Yoshemwa! Fumu na pinduka kwafu Simoni na mu mono.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />No iya erongwa idi iya ya tundire ku Emausi ya tongaurire edi a hokokire Yesu ku kwayo mu dikuñwa, nedi ya mu dimukire ou a kuyaurire dikende.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwirongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ete 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />O ku i ambaura eyo, popo Yesu wa nemanine mu kaci kayo, no ku amba ci: “Thsiyaro thsikare nenu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Yoihe ya cishutukire no ku yapa, kuma ya anekerire ci ngwa thsirumba ethsi i na mono. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Wa ipurire ci: “Ine eyi mu yapa no ku tamangera mu micima thzenu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mu mone mu nyara thzange nedyato yange. Yame shemwa! Mu ni kwatakwate ci mu cimonene, inene thsirumba po ka thsa wana nyama neshoko, unone ame po ni di nayo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ou a ambire kengeyo wa i monithsire nyara thzenthzi nedyato yenthzi.<verse eid="LUK 24:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Unone ayo ka ya tawire pakuninga ci shime ya nyanyukire no ku komoka, ngou a ipurire ci: “Ene mu diko nedya muno nji?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ya mu pire thsicimbi thso thsi o ku tereka. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Wa thsi shimbire no ku dya o kwa na mu tanekera.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Wa i amberire ci: “Eyi po yodiyo iya na ni mi tongweranga uya na nikaranga nenu ci eyi ya ñoriwire keyi yange yoihe mu Murao wa Mushe, Akwakukethza no mu vuka thzo Membo yaa roera ku citombora.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Wa thziturire maano ayo ci i yuverere Mañoro. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Wa i amberire ci: “Eyi ya ñoriwire po eyi, Mesiya aa roera ku nyandithsiwa no ku fa, unone kenge a ku pinduka kwafu mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Kucera evi ci i teteriwe kenge kwa ku hongiwa mu dithzina dyenthzi ku matunga oahe, ku tatekera mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Amwe po mwa mambangi weyi enu eyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ame kenge na ku ka mi tumithsera eyi a kumbwethzire Tata, mwikarange muno mu mbongi shime ou wa ku keya Mupepo Oukenu ku na mi pa okoro o ku tunda ku wiru.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa thzina mu wiru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ete 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yesu wa i tangererire ku thza ku Betania, ou a ka kumine wa yerurire moko enthzi mu wiru no ku i fiyawera. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />O ku i fiyawera kengeyo, wa i thsiire ayepo twariwa ku wiru. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ayo ya mu romberire no ku huka ku Yerusalema ko thsinyanyu thsothsikuru. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Thsikati thsothsihe shime na ikaranga mu Tembere, o ku i shangara Nyambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>